<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Bayso New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Yaannisa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yaannisa Kas'aafero Goottaakkaanki Kayesuusa Kiristoosa Wongala</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yaannisa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yan.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yaannisa kas'aafero</para>
  <para style="mt2">Goottaakkaanki Kayesuusa Kiristoosa Wongala</para>
  <para style="imt">Tabano</para>
  <para style="ip">Kayaannisa wongala Yesuusa kakkotusara ibaaddo lee ibaaddo orroo kamutero arddokki haafura kawaa laano tusinya, mas'aafa metekkeessayi goggotusaroo hikki wongala kakkoons'aafamera onabbabaraan Yesuusa kafayyisaro li emeeyinara kaɂamamere ere kawaa laano iso goggoɂammannawunna usuu ammananokotti aalanttii jiruu jiroommakki giri isoon kagiro laano goggoɂaddeesirawunya (20:31).</para>
  <para style="ip">Wongalaa tahoraarjjee banɂee jiruu jiroommakki haafura kawaanna Yesuusa raattoo iso koo laano tabano aani tuse abbaabatere Yesuusa kafayyisaro li emeeyinara kaɂamamere ere kawaa laano katusaro kalekaleekki baasakki malataal tusara, esekko hikka baasakki malaataalkko misitti laɂo helanttetto tatusatto jirtti malee giranaan; hitti banɂe tammammaakatta ibaaddo kookkoo Yesuusaayi ammanere usuu debee osessetaran laanokokki gara, okkalee adeen usu misii neebaateraanna iso usuu lakkoɂammananno goggoɂameeran maleeya, foolssi 13-17 Yesuusa takkoɂabamere hemeenii usukko oɂagaalssataranne wota eeki gitatti taɂatii esella usu abanaayena suwaamanokko horeene kaɂisiɂekkaasatanona kagoggoɂinna haafura usu isoon maalssisano iso ayeesaran. Kagachchoo foolssijjool abamano kayesuusakokki garana firddaawun hore aallano, suwaamanokkeessana goyikko kiyaanokkeessakokki gara, usumaleenna goyikko kiyaanokeessakko abbaabatere usukko oɂagaalssatarawun mutanokokki gara otusaraanyan.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yaannisa gara kayesuusa Kiristoosane kahelamaro jiruu jiroommakki giri addeesise kakkontusara hitti sino hittakko horenbbaan Yesuusa raa aani, rummi aani, giri aani yelateeren oɂatataraawunya. Wongala kayaannisa kalekki kayelara rummijol kaɂayyaana agaalssisin ogeerromeraanna barisano ohittariteetuun laɂo oɂatatanno, hikka amanona bekee, babo, ifa, kafoofee, idaad, akaakiltte kawoyiniinna il tawoyinii hikka aankikki kookojjool masuussa yeli aatanoya.</para>
  <para style="iot">Raattoo Hikki Mas'aafa Kaɂabera</para>
  <para style="io1">K'ofa tahoree <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 1:1-18">1:1-18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kat'ammak'aaro Yaannisana ohoraarjjee Yesuusakko oɂagaalssatareen <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 1:19-51">1:19-51</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesuusa handdaanokkeessa haggaɂabano <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 2:1-12:50">2:1—12:50</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Iyyerusaalemiinna gobobkkiseeyi kagachchoo handdaanokkeessakkokki arrijjool <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 13:1-19:42">13:1—19:42</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kagoottaa goyikko keyaanona usu oɂagaalssatarawun mutanokeessa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 20:1-31">20:1-31</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Gudisanoyi, Galiilaayi adiɂadi usukko oɂagaalssataranuun mutano <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 21:1-25">21:1-25</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Haafura kagiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1"/>Horaarjje haafura gire, haafurana Waa dollee gire, haafurana Waayye. <verse eid="JHN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2"/>Usuna horaarjje Waanneta gire. <verse eid="JHN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3"/>Kameen dubbana usu tonsse met't'aame, kamet't'aamero dubbakkona usu kallayii kamet't'taamera koonna laagiro. <verse eid="JHN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4"/>Neefo usuu gitte, hitti neefona ibaaddoon ifatte. <verse eid="JHN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5"/>Ifana mugudii hank'k'aara, mugudnna lakkoɂawodaro.<verse eid="JHN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6"/>Waakko kafaramera Yaannisa kaɂamamare ibaaddoti koo gire.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:1">Mat. 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mar. 1:4</ref>; Luk'. 3:1-2</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7"/>Ibaaddo dubba atonnatikkeessa maalire garakkeessane goggoɂammaniroon, ifa maraan ato liin emeete. <verse eid="JHN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8"/>Ifa maraan ato liin emeetera kuwaarre usu ussun ifa lakkoye. <verse eid="JHN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9"/>Ibaaddo dubbaan ifa kasisaro kalleera karrummii ifa alami tos emeetaa gire.<verse eid="JHN 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10"/>Usu alami orroo gire, alami kakkomet't'aamera usuu golleenna, alami ade usu lakkoɂaddeesere. <verse eid="JHN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11"/>Kakkeessa kalleero tos emeete. Fallikkeessana ade usu lakkoɂatatero. <verse eid="JHN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12"/>Halleewo kuwaarre oɂatateeraawunna megekkeessaa oɂammanaran dubbaawun ade ere kawaa takkoleeran feɂi sisera. <verse eid="JHN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13"/>Isona Waakko umulameenan kuwaarre, taɂiige goorttun tasooye feɂi goorttun tababbaar feɂikko lakkoɂumulameraan.<verse eid="JHN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14"/>Haafurana ibaaddo lee; sinonna rummii ammagame noo orroo baree. Aabbokkeessa dollekko kaɂemeetero, ere kookkotti kabajja noo deenne.<verse eid="JHN 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15"/>Yaannisana, «Inkko haarre kaɂemeetara inkko horeene mankkogire maraan inkko roorara ame ani kakkoonɂatotaare hikkanunya» amaa iyyee usu maraan atotee.<verse eid="JHN 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16"/>Sinottessa ammagamanokko kakkeeyi no dubbana sinoo gutii sino atannenna. <verse eid="JHN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17"/>Waa seera gara kamusene sisere, sinona rummina adde gara kayesuusa Kiristoosane emeete. <verse eid="JHN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18"/>Suurewana Waa kaddeera maayyona laagiro, ayesuun goɂameen Waa Odo dollee kagire ere koo kalleera Hedo usu noon addeesise.<verse eid="JHN 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kat'ammak'aare Yaannisakokki atonnati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat. 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar. 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk'. 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19"/>Ayihuudina, «Ati ayyotta?» ami goggohoosarawun tuuk'aamolnna woyyuul Iyyerusaalemikko usu tos kakkofaraneen, goorata Yaannisa kasisera atonnati hikkaye.<verse eid="JHN 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20"/>Atotaanokkona haar lakkogale; «Ani Kiristoosa lakkoyo» ame addeesise atotee.<verse eid="JHN 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21"/>Isona, «Hayya ati ayyotta? Eelaasatta?» ameen hoosaten.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Ada. 18:15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18">18</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mil. 4:5</ref>. </char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Usuna, «Lakkoyo» ame.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Isona, «Hayya kahegerootta?» ameen. Usuna, «Lakkoyo» ame abbaabe.<verse eid="JHN 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22"/>Isona; «Hayya ati ayyotta? Ati kafarttette ibaaddoon abbaab noo goggosinssoo isi oottaawun mematta?» ameen. <verse eid="JHN 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23"/>Yaannisana kahegeroo Isiyaasaa goggosegameroo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">«Goottawun raa ‹Ekkaasa amaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 1:23">k'alullattokki ulii taɂiyyaatte yaaye aniyya› » ame abbaabe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa. 40:3</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24"/>Farasaawilkko ofarameeranna, <verse eid="JHN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25"/>Haanna ameen; «Hayya Kiristoosa goorttun Eelaasa goorttun kahegeroo golleenon muun t'ammak'aatta?» ameen hoosaten.<verse eid="JHN 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26"/>Yaannisana, «Ani bekee t'ammak'aara, isin kakkasoonna ade isin orroo aalleera ame abbaabe. <verse eid="JHN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27"/>Inkko danbbenne kaɂemeetara, ani keferro oottessakokki shaano furin kakkodaaddeennoon usuya.»<verse eid="JHN 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28"/>Hikki dubba kalleera Yaannisa t'ammak'aa takkogire Yorddaanoskko, gamaa tabittaaniya katamaayiyye.<verse eid="JHN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Idaado kawaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29"/>Yaannisa tallami arri, Yesuusa usu tos kaɂemeetaro deere haa ame, «Hikkima! Alamikokki c'ubbo kabbaasara idaado kawaa, <verse eid="JHN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30"/>‹Inkko haarre kaɂemeetara inkko horeene mankkogire maraan inkko roorara› ani isinuun kaɂamare usuya. <verse eid="JHN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31"/>Ani metekkeewun lakkomalabere, bekee t'ammak'aa kaɂemeeyerana usu Isiraɂeel orroo goggomutiroonya» ame.<verse eid="JHN 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32"/>Esekkona Yaannisa, «Ayyaana arabe aani daruurkko dagere usu gutii hamas's'aa giraan dee. <verse eid="JHN 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33"/>Ani metekkeewun lakkomalabere ayesuun goɂameen bekee goggot'ammak'iroo kafarerana, ‹Ayyaana K'ulluukki kat'ammak'aara, Ayyaana dagaanna usu gutii hamas's'aa kamutara usuya› ame. <verse eid="JHN 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34"/>Aninna hikka deera, usu Ere kawaa laano atotinara» ame atonnati sise.<verse eid="JHN 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ohoraarjjee Yesuusakko oɂagaalssatareen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JHN 1:40-42">Yan. 1:40-42</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat. 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mar. 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:2-11">Luk'. 5:2-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35"/>Tallami arri Yaannisa Yesuusakko oɂagaalssatareen lamane wota ese banɂee aallee gire, <verse eid="JHN 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36"/>Yaannisa Yesuusa esene rooraa giraan deere, «Hikkima idaado kawaa!» ame.<verse eid="JHN 1:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37"/>Lama Yaannisakko oɂagaalssatareenna Yaannisa hikka ayeesaa giraan maaleeren Yesuusa debee sesseeten. <verse eid="JHN 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38"/>Yesuusana kamabbal amere usuu debee osesseetaran deere, «Me dootaattan?» ame hoosate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Isona, «Rabbi, haggee gitta?» Ameen, [«Rabbi» amano kaɂagaalssisaro amanoya.]<verse eid="JHN 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39"/>Usuna, «Koyeen diyaa» ame. «Haanssun seeterene usu mankkogiro deen,» eserrina usu wota hayeen, arriikkona saatii tomonkki goorata lee gire.<verse eid="JHN 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40"/>Yaannisa kaɂayeesero maaleen; Yesuusa debee osesseetaren lamakko koo kasimoona P'et'iroosakokki abbi Indiraasa gire. <verse eid="JHN 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41"/>Indiraasa horaarjje abbikkeessa Simoona helere, «Noo mesihi helannenna» ame, [«Mesihi» amano Kiristoosa amanoya.] <verse eid="JHN 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42"/>Yesuusa tonssa keene. Yesuusana deegure, «Ati kayoona ere Simoonatta, kefa amami uumaminatta» ame, «Kefa» amanona P'et'iroosa goorttun «eɂemo» amanoya.<verse eid="JHN 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Filp'oosana Naatinaɂeeli goggoɂuumero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43"/>Tallami arri, Yesuusa Galiila tos seeyin goosate, Filp'oosana helere, «Indebee sesseena» ame. <verse eid="JHN 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44"/>Filp'oosana Indiraasa P'et'iroosa aani kabeetesayida katamaakokki ibaaddotiyye. <verse eid="JHN 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45"/>Filp'oosa Naatinaɂeeli helere, «Musena kaseera mas'aafayi, kahegeroolnna usu maraan kakkoons'aafeeren kayoosefa ere kanaazireti Yesuusa helannenna» ame.<verse eid="JHN 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46"/>Naatinaɂeelina, «Naaziretikko kaɂidankki ayees helamin daanddaara?» ame. Filp'oosana, «Emeedde deena» ame.<verse eid="JHN 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47"/>Yesuusana Naatinaɂeeli usu tos kaɂemeetaro deere, «Hikkima, meellane kallayikki karrummii Isiraɂeeltti» amaa gara keessa ayeese.<verse eid="JHN 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48"/>Naatinaɂeelina «Ati in misii addeesse?» ame Yesuusa hoosate. Yesuusana, «Ati gaa kabalasi hegelii giraan, ganaa Filp'oosa ku haɂuumoon giraan ani ku deera» ame abbaabe.<verse eid="JHN 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49"/>Naatinaɂeelina abbaabere, «Kaɂagaalssisatto! Ati ere kawaatta, ati kaɂisiraɂeel wonotta» ame.<verse eid="JHN 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50"/>Yesuusana, «Ati Kaɂammanttetta, kabalasi gaa hegelii ani ku deera mankko amero maraanya? Ganaa hikkakko karoore ayees ati deeta» ame.<verse eid="JHN 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51"/>Adena, «Ani rumminaa rumminaa amara, daruur bananttedde, erggichcha kawaa Ere kaɂibaaddo gutii korataanna dagaa giraan dinnattaan» ame.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:12">Met'. 28:12</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 1:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa beke t'amo kawoyinnii tos iggilise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1"/>Taseedi arri tagaliila awuraajjaa, tak'aana katamaayi haassino gitte, Aaye tayesuusana esee gitte, <verse eid="JHN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2"/>Yesuusana usukko oɂagaalssatareenna banɂe tahaasinoo uumameen gireen. <verse eid="JHN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3"/>T'amo kawoyinnii kakkogudatare goorata Aaye tayesuusa, «T'amo kawoyinnii gudatelle antte.»<verse eid="JHN 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4"/>Yesuusana, «Ati heleelttiti ani me goggoyelloo dootatta? Gooratakki ganaa lakkogeero» ame.<verse eid="JHN 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5"/>Aayetteessana esee ogireen ohandaaraawun, «Usu kaɂamaro dubba fela» antte.<verse eid="JHN 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6"/>Kaɂayihuudi kahurufa seera malee, todobaatamkko kenkko taa boolnnee tomonkko ken liitiroo kaɂabara toossa lewo esee gire. <verse eid="JHN 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7"/>Yesuusa ohandaaranne «Toossaalii beke ammaga» ame. Isona toossaalii hiɂi geegiseen ammageen. <verse eid="JHN 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8"/>Usuna, «Guukko hummuusaddene min kahaasinokki aamoonna t'amoon odonnati kaɂaboon sisa» ame. Isona usu goggosegeerokki malee yeleen. <verse eid="JHN 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9"/>Odonnati kaɂabanaayekkina t'amo kawoyinii tos oɂiggilssameraan beke hummuge dee. Golleenna eetikko emeteeraan lakkoɂaddeesero, beke ohummuseraan ohandaareen adeen kasanayenwa; usuna kamashashee kale uumere, <verse eid="JHN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10"/>«Ibaaddo dubba horaarjje karoorisara kaɂidankki t'amo kawoyiniiyya, ibaaddona aaloo t'ame abbaabatere kadanbbee t'amo kawoyinnii roorisara ati adde kaɂidankki t'amo kawoyinnii gidda gin kayitetta» ame.<verse eid="JHN 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11"/>Yesuusana hikka baasakki malaataalkko kahoree tagaliila awuraajjaa K'aana katamaayi fele, kabajana tuse, usukko oɂagaalssatareenna usuu ammaneen.<verse eid="JHN 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12"/>Esekko abbaabatere Yesuusa Aayetteessanee, abbilaalteessanee, usukko oɂagaalssatarenne wota kak'ifirenaahoomi maaman tos dage, eseenna arri tic'c'ar hamas's'een.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:13">Mat. 4:13</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa k'ulluukki min kaɂebi ekkaase</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Mat. 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mar. 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luk'. 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13"/>Kaɂayihuudi baala kafaasikkaa goggogabalamee, Yesuusa Iyyerusaalemi tos bee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Biy. 12:1-27</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14"/>K'ulluukki min kawaakkotti ali orroo giddijjool, idaadjjoolnna arabejjool odaddalatareen usumaleenna hamas's'een maragade iggilissataa kadaddalatare ibaaddo hele. <verse eid="JHN 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15"/>Hassu goorata t'ork'aaye harɂe ekkaasere idaadjjoolnna giddijjool dubba min kaɂebikkotti ali orrokko horoore, maragade oɂiggilissatanenna maragadekisoo darɂee, t'arap'eezzalnna keese lugude.<verse eid="JHN 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16"/>Arabe odaddalatareenenna, «Hittakko beesa; Aabbokkeekki min kaddookki min arooyeltteen!» ame. <verse eid="JHN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17"/>Yesuusakko oɂagaalssatareenna, «Min kaawun tagitta idane gubatta» amame kas'aafamera isoon shaadame.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Mez. 69:9</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18"/>Ayihuudina, «Hikka dubba felanokaawun me malaata noon tusinatta?» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19"/>Yesuusana «Hikka min kaɂebi basa, aninna arri seed orroo abbaabi keesinara» ame abbaabe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:61">Mat. 26:61</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:40">27:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:58">Mar. 14:58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:29">15:29</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20"/>Ayihuudi, «Hikka k'ulluukki min kaɂebi madaarin gees afartamkko le gudisera, hayya ati misii arri seed orroo abbaabi madaarinnatta?» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21"/>Yesuusa k'ulluukki min kawaa goɂamiro ade isi ootteessakki maar ayeesanoye. <verse eid="JHN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22"/>Yesuusa goyikko kakko kee goorata, usukko oɂagaalssatareen usu me ayeesero shaaden, k'ulluukki mas'aafanna Yesuusa kaɂamero haafuraa ammaneen.<verse eid="JHN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23"/>Yesuusa kafaasikkaa baala Iyyerusaalemi katamaayi giraan, ibaaddo kamooggan usu kafelero malaataal deere megekeessaa ammane. <verse eid="JHN 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24"/>Yesuusa ade ibaaddo dubba mankkokaso maraan iso lakkoɂabddatere, <verse eid="JHN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25"/>Usu wodana taɂibaaddoo orroo kagiro mankkokaso maraan, maayyona gara kaɂibaaddoo usuun goggoɂatotiroon lakkodootisero.<verse eid="JHN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusana Nik'odimoosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1"/>Tafarasawi unana, kaɂayihuudi woyichchaalkko koo kalleera Nik'odimoosa kaɂamamare ibaaddoti gire. <verse eid="JHN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2"/>Usu ibaaddotina hemeen Yesuusa tos emetere, «Kaɂagaalssisatto! Waa usune wota kallee ibaaddoti kuwaarre ati kafelatto baasakki malaata maayyona felin mankkodaanddeennon maraan, Waa dollekko kaɂemettettona kaɂagaalssisatto laano noo kanssowa» ame.<verse eid="JHN 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3"/>Yesuusana abbaabere, «Ani rumminaa rumminaa amara, maayyona kallami goɂumulame kuwaarre wononnati kawaa din lakkodaanddaaro» ame.<verse eid="JHN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4"/>«Nik'odimoosana ibaaddo doɂayire abbaabayi misii umulamin daanddaara? Kallami umulamin abbaabayi gedeemi taɂaawoo tos tabin daanddaara?» ame hoosate.<verse eid="JHN 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5"/>Yesuusana haa ame abbaabe; «Ani rumminaa rumminaa amara, maayyona bekekkona Ayyaanakko goɂumulame kuwaarre wononnati kawaa tos tabin lakkodaanddaaro. <verse eid="JHN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6"/>Ibaaddokko kaɂumulame ibaaddoya, Ayyaanakko kaɂumulamena ayyaanaya. <verse eid="JHN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7"/>‹Kallami umulamano dootisara ani mankko ame maraan aroosaadde.› <verse eid="JHN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8"/>Ambbal mankkogeelaatte kiyaatta, yaayena maalatta, ayesuun goɂameen eetikko emaatto, eetirraa seyattona laakkasso, Ayyaanakko kaɂumulame dubbana hikkamaleeya» ame abbaabe.<verse eid="JHN 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9"/>Nik'odimoosana «Hikki misii liin daanddaara?» ame hoosate.<verse eid="JHN 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10"/>Yesuusana «Ati Isiraɂeel kaɂagaalssisatto» leete giraan hikka ayees laakkassoya? <verse eid="JHN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11"/>Ani rumminaa rumminaa amara, kakkansso ayeesinanna, kaddeenenno atotinanna, isin addeen atotaanokaanina lakkoɂataattaan. <verse eid="JHN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12"/>Gara kaɂuleekki ayees ani isinuun gosegiro ammanatana kawattettaan, kadaruuree ayees gosegee misii ammanayinattaan? <verse eid="JHN 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13"/>Daruurkko kadagero Ere kaɂibaaddo kuwaarre, daruur tos kabbeera maayyona laagiro ame abbaabe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Daruurkko kadagero ere aɂibaaddoo kuwaarre daruur tos kabeera koonna laagiro «Kookkoo kahorkkoo mas'aafal» daruuri kagiro ere kaɂibaaddo kuwaarre amara. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14"/>Muse k'alullattokki ulii habeessa goggosuyere malee, Ere kaɂibaaddona usumalee suwaamin dootisara. <verse eid="JHN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15"/>Hikkina usuu kaɂammane dubba jiruu jiroommakki giri goggogirroonya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:9">To. 21:9</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16"/>«Usuu kaɂammane dubba jiruu jiroommakki giri goggogirroon kuwaarre goggobaannonkko Waa Ere koo taasisiroo alami adda geelatera. <verse eid="JHN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17"/>Waa Erekkeessa alami tos kakkoon farera alami gutii firddin halleennon giraan, alami usuuyi goggofayyironya. <verse eid="JHN 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18"/>Usuu kaɂammanara dubba lakkofirddaamaro, usuu kaɂammanoon ade koo Ere kawaakki megee mankko ammanoon giro maraan, t'ayewa firddaamera. <verse eid="JHN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19"/>Firddana hikkaya, ifa alami tos emeete, ibaaddo ade feloɂoottiso omeellan mankkoleen maraan, ifakko roorisate mugud geelate. <verse eid="JHN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20"/>Tameellan kafelara dubba ifa diidara, felo omeellan ootteessa goggomutoonkko ifa tos lakkoɂemeetaro. <verse eid="JHN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21"/>Rummii kasesseetara ade felo Waayi ofelameraan laano addeesami mutin ifa tos emeetara.»<verse eid="JHN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kat'ammak'aare Yaannisa gara kayesuusa atotee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22"/>Esekko abbaabatere Yesuusana usukko oɂagaalssatareenna ul kayihuuda seeteen, eseenna iso t'ammak'aa abaraan adallaate. <verse eid="JHN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23"/>Hassu goorata Yaannisa Saalemi dollee Heenon taɂamamatto banɂee beke onjjiin mankkogireen maraan, t'ammak'aa gire, ibaaddona t'ammak'amin emeetaa gire. <verse eid="JHN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24"/>Hikkina kalleera Yaannisa hashaamoon giraanye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mat. 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mar. 6:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Luk'. 3:19-20</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25"/>Kookkoo Yaannisakko oɂagaalssatareenna Ayihuudi orroo hurufaamanokokki seeraa dogamaa keete.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ayihuudi: kookkoo kahorkkoo mas'aafal Ayihuudi wuc'ariiyi amara.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26"/>Yaannisakko oɂagaalssatareen Yaannisa tonssa emeetenen, «Kaɂagaalssisatto, Yorddaanoskko gamaa kuunne wota kagire, garakkeessana ati kakkoonɂatotiitetta ibaaddoti, hikkima t'ammak'aara, ibaaddo dubba usu tos seetaa gira» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27"/>Yaannisana, «Waakko gosisame kuwaarre maayyona koonna atayin lakkodaanddaaro ame abbaabe. <verse eid="JHN 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28"/>‹Ani lakkokiristoosayyo, ayesuun goɂameen usukko horene faramera› kaɂamero isin metekisiniiwa atotinattaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:20">Yan. 1:20</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29"/>Mashaashe kakkongitta usu kamashaasheeya, yaaye maalin dollee kaɂaallaara saati ade, yaaye tamashaashee gomaallo aaloo geggelaatara, haanssun hasse geggelaanjjetti, gidda gudatetta. <verse eid="JHN 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30"/>Usu t'ok'k'i t'ok'k'i amin, ani ade yeraayin dootisara ame abbaabe.<verse eid="JHN 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31"/>«Elekko kaɂemeetara dubbaankko kanjjiinkiya, ulkko kalleera kaɂuleeya, taɂuleenna ayeesara, daruurkko kaɂemeetera dubbaankko kanjjiinkiya. <verse eid="JHN 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32"/>Usu kaddeerona kamaalero atotaara, ayesuun goɂameen atonnatikeessa maayyona lakkoɂatataro. <verse eid="JHN 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33"/>Atonnatikeessana kaɂatatere ibaaddo, Waa karrummii laano addeese. <verse eid="JHN 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34"/>Waa ayyaanakkeessa jiinase mankkosisaro maraan, Waa kafarera usu haafura kawaa ayeesara. <verse eid="JHN 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35"/>Odo Erekkeessa geelaatara, kameen dubbana genetteesaa sisera.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:27">Mat. 11:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:22">Luk'. 10:22</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36"/>Erekkeessayi kaɂammanara dubba jiruu jiroommakki giri aba, Erekkeessaa kaɂammanoon ade engge tawaa usu gutii laatta kuwaarre giri lakkohelataro.»<verse eid="JHN 3:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa tasamaraawiti heleelttiti too wota ayeese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1"/>Kafarasaawi ibaaddo Yaannisakko roore Yesuusa omooggan usukko oɂagaalssataran ekkasanona t'ammak'aano maaleen.<verse eid="JHN 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2"/>Ayesuun goɂameen kat'ammak'eera Yesuusa halleennon giraan usukko oɂagaalssatarenyan. <verse eid="JHN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3"/>Yesuusana hikka goggoɂaddeese ul kayihuuda iisere Galiila tos abbaabate seete. <verse eid="JHN 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4"/>Eserraa seetaa giraan Samaariya orrone roorano dootisare.<verse eid="JHN 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5"/>Haanssun Samaariyanne, Yayik'ooba ere keessa Yoosefaan takkosisero banɂe dollee tagitto Sikaari taɂamamatto katamaa tos emeete.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 33:19">Met'. 33:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Iya. 24:32</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6"/>Eseenna kayayik'ooba gumbbi kabekee gire, Yesuusana sesseettaankko kakkeeyi hare mankkogire maraan gumbbi kabekee dollee hamas's'ee, gooratana arrikko saatii lekki goorataye.<verse eid="JHN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7"/>Heleelttiti too tasamarawiti beke hummusayin kakkoɂemaatte goorata Yesuusa, «In beke t'amisina» ame. <verse eid="JHN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8"/>Yesuusakko oɂagaalssatareen babo iminayin katamaa tos seeteen gireen. <verse eid="JHN 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9"/>Ese Samaraawitina, «Ati Ayihuuditi leete giraan, in Samaraawi heleelttitine misii beke t'amisin amatta?» Antte, hikka amanona Ayihuudin Samarawijjoolnne wota esella mankkoginnoon maraanye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 4:1-5">Iz. 4:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 4:12">Neh. 4:12</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10"/>Yesuusana abbaabere, «Ilabo kawaa addeessewa in beke t'amisi kaɂamara ayyoyo addeesi gittewa atiwa usukko hoosaattewa, usuna beke oggiri kuun sisarewa» ame.<verse eid="JHN 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11"/>Heleelttitina haa antte, «Goottakki, ati kakkohummusinaa lakkoɂabtto, gumbbina keelddokkiya, hayya hinɂa beke oggiri eetikko helnnatta? <verse eid="JHN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12"/>Ayesuun goɂameen, ati hikka gumbbi noon kasisero Aabbokaani Yayik'oobakko rooratta? Usuna Yiiskeessa, giddikeessana hikka gumbbikko t'ameenan,» antte.<verse eid="JHN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13"/>Yesuusana «Hinɂa bekekko kat'amara danbbe sugubaayinara, <verse eid="JHN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14"/>Ani osisaro bekekko kat'amara ade suurewa lakkosugubaaro, ani osisaro beke kat'amara ibaaddo jiruu jiroommaan kafulttaaro kagiri bekekkokki fultto laara» ame abbaabe.<verse eid="JHN 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15"/>Heleelttitina, «Goottakki, ani goggosugubaanonkkona beke hummusayin goggosesseenoonkko, maganne hinɂa beke iin sisi» antte.<verse eid="JHN 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16"/>Yesuusana, «Seedde entterkkaa uumi koyi ame.»<verse eid="JHN 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17"/>Heleelttitina, «Ani entter lakkoɂabo» antte abbaabtte.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Yesuusana, «Entter lakkoɂabo amano garaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18"/>Ogiraan entter ken kuun kagire, gidda kunne wota kagirana entterkkaa mankkolleennoon maraan, kaɂayeesetta rummiya» ame abbaabe.<verse eid="JHN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19"/>Heleelttitina, «Goottakki, ati kahegeroo laano gidda ani addeese. <verse eid="JHN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20"/>Odolaalkkaani hitta wodami gutii sagadeen, isin Ayihuudi addeen ibaaddo sagadin kakkoondootisara Iyyerusaalemiya amattaan» antte.<verse eid="JHN 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21"/>Yesuusana, «Ati heleelttiti, hitta wodamii leere Iyyerusaalemiinna Odoon kakkosagadoon goorata emeetaa girano ammani. <verse eid="JHN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22"/>Isin ibaaddo kasamaarya kakkasootun sagadattaan, noo andde fayyinna Ayihuudikko mankkoleero maraan noo kakkanssoon sagadanna. <verse eid="JHN 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23"/>Rummii osagadaraan; Odoon ayyaanaanna rummii kakkosagadiraan goorata emeetara, giddanna emeetera, Odona hikkamalee rummii osagadaraan dootara. <verse eid="JHN 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24"/>Waa ayyaanaya; osagadaraanna ayyaanaanna rummii sagadano dootisara» ame.<verse eid="JHN 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25"/>Heleelttitina, «Kiristoosa kaɂamamara kashigidame emeeyin girano kasowa, usu goɂemeete ayees dubba noon seginara» antte.<verse eid="JHN 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26"/>Yesuusana, «Kaɂayeesisara hayya ani usuyyo» ame addeesise garakkeessa eseen segee.<verse eid="JHN 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Samaraawitikokki atonnati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27"/>Usu goorata Yesuusakko oɂagaalssatareen abbaabateen emeeten, usu heleelttitine wota ayeesaa giraan deengureen saadeen, golleenna ade, «Me dootaatta?» goorttun, «Ese wota kakkoonɂayeesatta mewuunya?» ame usu kahoosatera maayyona laagire.<verse eid="JHN 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28"/>Heleelttitina uulla iissedde katamaa tos abbaabate, gosaanna, haa antte. <verse eid="JHN 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29"/>«Ani kafelero dubba iin kasegeero ibaaddoti koyeen diyaa, usu Kiristoosa leewuna?» antte. <verse eid="JHN 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30"/>Isona katamaakko beeren usu mankkogiro tos seeteen.<verse eid="JHN 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31"/>Usu goorata Yesuusakko oɂagaalssatareen, «Kaɂagaalssisatto, babo aami» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32"/>Usu ade, «Isin kakkasoon ani kaɂaamaro babo aba» ame.<verse eid="JHN 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33"/>Usukko oɂagaalssatareenna, «Ibaaddo usuun babo keeni girro?» amaa isirroo ayeeseen. <verse eid="JHN 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34"/>Yesuusana, «Babo kakki in kafarerokotti feɂi felanona felo oottessa gudisanoya. <verse eid="JHN 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35"/>Isin, ‹Diginni afarkko haarre wut'a giyaara› laa amattaanna? Hikkima, wut'a kukkumin gabbalamano ‹t'ok'k'i maddeene ira diyaa› ame. <verse eid="JHN 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36"/>Katagatara giddanna gollee daamooza kaɂatateya, jiruu jiroommakki girin talleeto il kukkuyisatara, hikkina kawut'aterana katagatara wota goggogeggelaanawunya. <verse eid="JHN 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37"/>Haanssun, ‹Koo wut'atara, kakkalee ade tagatara› kaɂamamera masuussa rummiya. <verse eid="JHN 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38"/>Kandaafuroon gittaan goggotagataawun farera, kakkalee felooyi hare, isin addeen daafurkkisootti il kukkuyisatteen» ame.<verse eid="JHN 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kamooggan kasamaraawi ibaaddo Waayi ammane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39"/>Heleelttiti, «Ani kafelero dubba iin segee» Antte mankko atotiite maraan ese katamaakko kamooggan kasamaraawi ibaaddo usuu ammane. <verse eid="JHN 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40"/>Haanssun, kasamaraawi ibaaddo Yesuusa tos takkoɂemeteree Yesuusana iso wota goggoɂadallaaron ataayiseen usu ebaaten, usuna arri lama esee adallaate.<verse eid="JHN 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41"/>Haafurakeessakkona kakkeeyi kakkalee kamooggan ibaaddo ammane.<verse eid="JHN 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42"/>Heleelttitinena, «Goortta noo usuu kakkoon ammananna ati noon mankko segite kaalaawun lakkoyo, noo issiiwa maalnenna, hikki ibaaddoti rumminaa alami kafayyiisaro laano kanssowa» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 4:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa ere kashuumi fayyiise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43"/>Yesuusa arri lamakko abbaabatere Galiila tos seete. <verse eid="JHN 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44"/>«Kahegeroo ulkkeessaa lakkokabajaamaro» ame Yesuusa issiiwa ayeese gire.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:57">Mat. 13:57</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:4">Mar. 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:24">Luk'. 4:24</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45"/>Galiila goggogeeyinna kagaliila ibaaddo geggelaanjjee usu atate, aalantina, iso kafaasikkaa baala Iyyerusaalemi mankkogire maraanna esee kafelero dubba mankko deeran maraanya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:23">Yan. 2:23</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 4:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46"/>Yesuusana beke t'amo kawoyinii tos takkoɂiggilsero, Galiilaa tagitto K'aana katamaa tos kallami emeete, K'ifirenaahoomina ere kakkoonhawɂaamere koo min kawonokokki shuumii gire.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:1-11">Yan. 2:1-11</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47"/>Hikki ibaaddotina Yesuusa Yihuudakko Galiila tos emeetano kakkomaalare goorata, usu tos seetere hawɂaamere goyi hiɂi kagiro erekkeessa emeeyi goggofayyisiroo ebaate. <verse eid="JHN 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48"/>Yesuusana, «Maagoreenna isin malaatana baasakki ayees goddeennoon lakkoɂammanattaan» ame.<verse eid="JHN 4:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49"/>Shuumitina, «Goottakki, erekki gowaanokko horenne maganne geena» ame.<verse eid="JHN 4:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50"/>Yesuusana, «Erekka neefo gira see» ame,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Ibaaddotina Yesuusa kaɂayeesero haafuraa ammane seete. <verse eid="JHN 4:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51"/>Raadii giranttuunna ohanddaaren usu heleeren, «Erekka fayyeera» ameen usuun segeen.<verse eid="JHN 4:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52"/>Usuna erekkeessa saatii miyyaayi iidero gohoosaro, «Maar gubanona usu kakkogafarera kele saatii todobaayiya» ameen. <verse eid="JHN 4:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53"/>Kaɂunnuti odona Yesuusa, «Erekka neefone gira» takkoɂamero saatii laano addeese, usuna kaminee ibaaddo keessa dubba Yesuusaa ammaneen.<verse eid="JHN 4:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54"/>Hikkina, Yesuusa Yihuudakko Galiila tos emeete kafelero kallamikki baasakki malaataye.<verse eid="JHN 4:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Beetesayidaa kafelamero fayyinna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1"/>Esekko abbaabatere kaɂayihuudi baala mankkogire maraan, Yesuusa Iyyerusaalemi tos bee. <verse eid="JHN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2"/>Iyyerusaalemiinna, kaɂidaad ufa dollee, karra ken guuntte kasaarame kakkosesseetaran taɂabtta, heɂi taɂaramayikkii Beetesayida taɂamamatte banɂee kakkot'ammak'araan kafultto eela koo gire.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Beetesayida: kookkoo kahorkkoo mas'aafal Beetezaata kakkalee ade Beetehesida amara; fureenna min kashaaga amanoya.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3"/>Hikka kakkosesseetaran raajjoolii kamooggan naafaleessaal, Iilɂoo kadiyannoon, oɂesaraanna naafaleessaal huddureen gireen. [Bekekokki aɂaanona oorataa, <verse eid="JHN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4"/>Roore roore erggichcha kawaa dage beke kakkoɂaaɂisaro goorata, t'aye eela tos katabe kaɂabo dhukuba maamisikikkona fayyaa gire.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kahorkkoo mas'aafal tooto 3 gachchokko haggaɂabere taa tooto 4 gachcho geeroon kagiro lakkoɂadaro.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5"/>Eseenna gees sonddomkko siddeedun dhukubaaleessa lee kagire ibaaddoti koo gire. <verse eid="JHN 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6"/>Yesuusana hikka ibaaddoti esee kahuddurero deegure, goorata kamoogganun hikkamalee girano addeesere «Fayyiin dootaatta?» ame.<verse eid="JHN 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7"/>Dhukubaaleessatinna abbaabere, «Goottaa! Beke kakkoɂaaɂiraan goorata eela tos in kadagisiro ibaaddo lakkoɂabo, ani tabin gohediro kakkalee horehaara» ame.<verse eid="JHN 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8"/>Yesuusana, «Ki! Takkohuddurttetto alggaattaa sidadde gali» ame. <verse eid="JHN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9"/>Ibaaddotina goorsewa fayyee, takkohudurere alggaana sidate gale.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Hikkina kalleera Ayihuudin tafoolssi arriiyye, <verse eid="JHN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10"/>Ayihuudin odonnati oɂabaanna kafayyeero ibaaddotine, «Tafoolssii arri mankkolleete maraan takkohuddurttetto alggaattaa goggosidattoon seera kuun feɂi lakkosisaro ameen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:19">Neh. 13:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:21">Erm. 17:21</ref>.</char></note>»<verse eid="JHN 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11"/>Usu ade, «Aankki in kafayyisera ibaaddoti, ‹Takkohuddurttetto alggaattaa sidadde gali› amera» ame abbaabe.<verse eid="JHN 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12"/>Isona, «Takkohuddurttetto alggaattaa sidadde gali kaɂamera usu ayoyya?» ameen hoosaten.<verse eid="JHN 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13"/>Yesuusana fakkime seete gosa orroo tabe mankkogire maraan, ibaaddotina maayyo usu fayyisero lakkoɂaddeesero.<verse eid="JHN 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14"/>Esekko abbaabatere Yesuusa usu ibaaddoti min kaɂebi orroo helere, «Hikkima, fayyiitetta, hikkako karoore ayees ku goggogeennonkko hittakko danbbeebaan adi c'ubbo aroofeltte» ame. <verse eid="JHN 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15"/>Ibaaddotina usu kafayyisera Yesuusa laano seete Ayihuudin segee.<verse eid="JHN 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ere kawaa neefo sisara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16"/>Ayihuudin odonnati oɂabaan, tafoolsii arrittisooyi hinɂi felo felamanooyi, Yesuusa horoorano haggaɂabeen. <verse eid="JHN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17"/>Yesuusana, «Odokki gidda giin felaa gira, aninna adi felnara» ame.<verse eid="JHN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18"/>Goortta Ayihuudin odonnati oɂabaan, Yesuusa tafoolsii arrittisoo mankkoɂiggilise kaalaawun halleennon giraan Waa Odo yelate, isiɂootteessa Waanneta ekka yelatanooyi, lagadin ataayiseen dootaa gireen.<verse eid="JHN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ere kawaakkokki odonnati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19"/>Yesuusana; «Ani rumminaa rumminaa amara, Odo felaa giraan kaddeero kaalaal kuwaarre Ere kale iskko koonna felin lakkodaanddaaro, Odo kafelaro dubba Ere kawaa ade felara. <verse eid="JHN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20"/>Odo Ere mankkogeelataro maraan usu issii kafelaro dubba tusara, goggosaadawunna hikkakko karoore ayees tusirowa. <verse eid="JHN 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21"/>Aalantina Odo kagoye goggokeesaro malee, neefona goggosisaroo malee, Ere kawaanna ade kadootate dubbaan giri sisara. <verse eid="JHN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22"/>Odo maayyo gutiinna lakkofirddaaro, ayesuun goɂameen firdda dubba Erekkeessaan roorise sisera. <verse eid="JHN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23"/>Hikkina, Odo goggokabajaana malee dubba Erekkeesaana goggokabajiinawunya, Ere kawaa kakkabajjiinoon, kafarero Odona lakkokabajaaro.<verse eid="JHN 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24"/>«Ani rumminaa rumminaa amara, haafurakkee kamaalara, in kafareroonna kaɂammanara jiruu jiroommakki giri aba, goyikko giri tos nak'era kuwaarre firdda tos lakkoɂemeetaro. <verse eid="JHN 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25"/>Ani rumminaa rumminaa amara, kagoyera ibaaddo Ere kawaakotti yaaye kakkomaallan goorata emeetara, gooratana giddaaya, ommaalaraanna neefo girinanaa. <verse eid="JHN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26"/>Odo issiiwa kagiri fultto goggolleeroo usumalee, Erekkeessana metekkeesawun kagiri fultto goggolleeroon yelera. <verse eid="JHN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27"/>Usuna Ere kaɂibaaddo mankkollee maraan firdda goggofirddiroon odonnati sisera.<verse eid="JHN 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28"/>«Hikkanii aroosaaddeen, k'amalameen ogiraan dubba yaayetteessa kakkomaallaan goorata emeetara. <verse eid="JHN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29"/>Taɂidan ofeleeran girkokki kiyaanoon, tameellan ofeleeran adeen kiirene firdda atayinaraan ame.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan. 12:2</ref>.</char></note>»<verse eid="JHN 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gara kayesuusa kasisamero atonnati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30"/>«Ani kale iskko koonna felin lakkodaanddaaro, ani kafirddaara kamaalaro kaalaaya, in kafarerokotti feɂi kuwaarre feɂittee mankko dootannoon maraan firddakki garaya.<verse eid="JHN 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31"/>«Ani isiɂootteewun goɂatotee, atonnatikki atamano lakkoɂabo. <verse eid="JHN 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32"/>In maraan kaɂatotaara kakkalee gira, usu in maraan kasisinara atonnati rummi laano ani kasowa.<verse eid="JHN 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33"/>«Isin Yaannisa tos fartteetten, usuna gara karrummii atoteera.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:19-27">Yan. 1:19-27</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 3:27-30">3:27-30</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34"/>Ani atotaano kaɂibaaddo kaɂatataro lakkoyo, ani hikka kakkoonɂayeesara ade isin goggofayyitawunya. <verse eid="JHN 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35"/>Yaannisa beebaa ifa kasisaro korroontta aaniyye, isinna goorata kic'c'arun ifakkeessayi geggelaayin dootatteen.<verse eid="JHN 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36"/>«Ani ade kayaannisa atonnatikko karoore atonnati aba, goggogudisiroon Odo osisera, aninna ofelara felo odo in farano atotaaran. <verse eid="JHN 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37"/>In kafarera Odo usuwa garakkee atoteera; isin addeen yaayetteessa suure lakkomaalttettaan, midditteesana suure lakkodeeteettaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat. 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar. 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk'. 3:22</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38"/>In kafareroonna mankkoɂammanana waatteen maraan haafurakkeessa isinii lakkogiro. <verse eid="JHN 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39"/>Isin mas'aafa k'ulluukkiinna jiruu jiroommakki giri ohelayinnattaan aani mankkollaaro maraan mas'aafal k'ok'k'orattaan, hikki mas'aafana garakkee kaɂatotaaroya; <verse eid="JHN 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40"/>Isin addeen, neefo girin in tos emeeyin lakkodootattaan.<verse eid="JHN 5:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41"/>«Ani ibaaddokko kabaja lakkodootataro; <verse eid="JHN 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42"/>Ayesuun goɂameen ani isin kasowa; geelanjje tawaanna wodanattisinii orroo giriwaatti ani kasowa. <verse eid="JHN 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43"/>Ani Aabbokkeekki megee emeeye isin goɂameen in lakkoɂatatteettaan; kakkalee megekkeessaa emetewa atatatteenwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44"/>Isin isiɂisiorroo kabaja osisattaan, ayesuun goɂameen Waa kookko taɂemaatto kabaja odootannoon golleeten, misii ammanin daanddaattan?<verse eid="JHN 5:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45"/>«Kamootarakkisin abddi kakkoonlugudatteettan Muse kuwaarre, ani odo horee isin kamootaro aani aroolleenno; <verse eid="JHN 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46"/>Muse kaɂammanattaan leeteenwa, in ammanatteenwa; aalantina usu kas'aafera garakkeeya. <verse eid="JHN 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47"/>Usu kas'aafero goɂammanannoon, ani kaɂayeesaro haafurakkee misii ammaninnattaan?» ame.<verse eid="JHN 5:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa ibaaddo kuma ken aamise</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat. 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:32-44">Mar. 6:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk'. 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1"/>Hittakko danbbenne Yesuusa T'ibraadoosi taɂamamatte tagaliila labukko gama nak'ere labu girnne seete. <verse eid="JHN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2"/>Ibaaddo kamoogganna dhukubaaleessaal fayyiisaa kafelero baasakki malaatajjool mankkodeeraan maraan debee sesseeteen. <verse eid="JHN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3"/>Esekona Yesuusa wodami tos beere usukko oɂagaalsisaraane wota hamas's'ee. <verse eid="JHN 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4"/>Kaɂayihuudi faasikkaa baalana gabbalame gire. <verse eid="JHN 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5"/>Yesuusana t'ok'k'ime gosa kamooggan usu tos emeetaa kagiro deere; Filp'oosane, «Hikki ibaaddo goggoɂaamiroon babo eetikko iminna?» ame. <verse eid="JHN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6"/>Hikka kakkonhoosatera usu c'aafinya kuwaarre usu ussun felin kahedere kasanaayewa.<verse eid="JHN 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7"/>Filp'oosana, «Mete metee ibaaddo kic'c'ar kic'c'ar goggok'ammasiroon yelin, diinaara lama booleekki buddeena lakkolleero» ame abbaabe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Diinaara: felate kabbaraaroon arri tootti muraatta </char></note><verse eid="JHN 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8"/>Yesuusakko oɂagaalssatarenkko koo, kasimoona P'et'iroosakokki abbi Indiraasana haa ame; <verse eid="JHN 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9"/>«Kahaɂuree babo kenna kunɂub lama kaɂabera unnu koo hittanii gira, hikki ade hikka gosa dubbaan misii geeginara?»<verse eid="JHN 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10"/>Yesuusana, «Ibaaddo goggohamas'iroon yela» ame, ese banɂee ees kamooggan gire, ibaaddona hamas's'ee tootoɂoottisona kuma ken kalleeroye. <verse eid="JHN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11"/>Yesuusa babo ken keese galatee kakkoɂabbaabatare goorata, kahamas'eero gosaan hedeeden, kunɂubna usumaleewwa hedeeden dubbana kadootisaro gitakki helateen. <verse eid="JHN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12"/>Dubba aame kakkobararare goorata, Yesuusa usukko oɂagaalssatarenne, «Tahessetto hanbbakko toonna goggodarɂaamonkko kukkuyisa» ame. <verse eid="JHN 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13"/>Isona, kaɂaamamero kahaɂuree babo kenkko tahessetto hanbba dugud tomonkko lama kukkuyiseen ammageen.<verse eid="JHN 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14"/>Ibaaddo Yesuusa kafelero baasakki malaata kakkodiyaaren goorata, «Alami tos kaɂemeetara kahegeroo ogiraan hikkaya» ameen. <verse eid="JHN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15"/>Yesuusana ibaaddo emeeyire hunnaa usu wono yelayin k'oppaanokisoo addeesere adena kalekalee wodami tos seete.<verse eid="JHN 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa beke gutii sesseetaa seete</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat. 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mar. 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16"/>Ul hemeen kakkollaare goorata usukko oɂagaalssatareen labu dageen. <verse eid="JHN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17"/>Wolaboonna koratenee K'ifirenaahoomi tos nak'in keen. Gooratana hemeen leere, Yesuusana ganaa iso tos lakkoɂemetere. <verse eid="JHN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18"/>Ambbal taɂatii mankko kiyaa gitte maraan beke keen. <verse eid="JHN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19"/>Kilo metira ken goorttun le duudeen giraan, Yesuusa beke gutii sesseetaa wolabo tos kaɂemeetaro deenee abssateen. <verse eid="JHN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20"/>Yesuusa ade, «Aniya, arooɂabssatteen» ame. <verse eid="JHN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21"/>Isona usu goggokoraroo dootateen, wolabona goorsewa mankko seetaraan geete baga abatte.<verse eid="JHN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22"/>Tallami arri bekekko gamanne kahesera ibaaddo esee wolabo too taalaal girano addeese, Yesuusa ade wolabooyi koratanawaattina usukko oɂagaalssatareen kale nak'anona addeese. <verse eid="JHN 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23"/>Esekko abbaabatere, kakkalee wolabool T'ibraadooskko, Goottaa kasommaasatero babo gosa mankko aamero banɂe tos emeete. <verse eid="JHN 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24"/>Ibaaddona, Yesuusa goorttun usukko oɂagaalssatareen esee giranawaatti goggoɂaddeeseenii, Yesuusa dootaa wolaboolii tabeen K'ifirenaahoomi tos seeteen.<verse eid="JHN 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa kagiri baboya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25"/>Bekekko gamanne usu kakkohelareen goorata, «Kaɂagaalssisatto, ati hittarraa goree emeetetta?» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26"/>Yesuusana, «Ani rumminaa rumminaa amara in kakkondootattaan babo mankkoɂaantteen maraanna mankkobarartteen kuwaarre, malaata mankkodeeten maraan lakkoyo. <verse eid="JHN 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27"/>Kabbaaro baboon aroofeltteen, ayesuun goɂameen Ere kaɂibaaddo kasisaro jiruu jiroommakki giri kalleero baboon fela, hikkina Waa Odo kaɂaddeesisaro maatama usu gutii kayera.»<verse eid="JHN 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28"/>Isona, «Hayya felo owaa felin me yelano dootisara?» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29"/>Yesuusana, «Usu kafareroyii goggoɂammanttaawun, hinɂi felo owaayyan» ame abbaabe.<verse eid="JHN 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30"/>Isona, «Noo diigunne ku goggoɂammannoon me malaata felnatta? Menna yelnnatta? Ameen hoosaten. <verse eid="JHN 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31"/>Goggoɂaaminawun daruurkko babo sisera amame goggos'aafameroo, odolaalkkaani k'alullattokki ulii babo kadaruure aameen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:4">Biy. 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 15">15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:24">Mez. 78:24</ref>.</char></note>»<verse eid="JHN 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32"/>Haanssun Yesuusana, «Ani rumminaa rumminaa amara, daruurkko babo kasisara lakkomuseyo, karrummii babo daruurkko kasisara ade Odokkeeya. <verse eid="JHN 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33"/>Babo kawaa usu daruurkko kadagarona alamiin giri kasisaroya» ame. <verse eid="JHN 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34"/>Isona, «Goottaa, goorttanun hikka babo arri dubba noon sisi» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35"/>Yesuusana haa ame; «Kagiri babo aniya, in tos kaɂemeetara duuddo lakkoɂuɂiro, iyyeenna kaɂammane suure lakkosugubaaro. <verse eid="JHN 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36"/>Ayesuun goɂameen ani isinuun goggosegeeroo, deetettan gidanna suure lakkoɂammanattaan. <verse eid="JHN 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37"/>Odo kasisara dubba in tos emeetara; in tos kaɂemeetarona suure saarddese lakkohorooraro. <verse eid="JHN 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38"/>Daruurkko ani kakkoondagera feɂittee felayin anlleennon giraan, kafarerokotti feɂi feli gudisinya. <verse eid="JHN 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39"/>In kafarerokotti feɂi, kasisero dubbakko koonna habbaannon giraan tagachchoo arri goyikko goggokeesironya. <verse eid="JHN 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40"/>Aabbokkeetti feɂi Ere deere usuuyi kaɂammanara dubba jiruu jiroommakki giri goggogirroniya, aninna tagachchoo arri goyikko keesinnara.»<verse eid="JHN 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41"/>Ayihuudina «Daruurkko kadagera babo aniya» amanokkeessaan gumggumaano haggaɂabeen. <verse eid="JHN 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42"/>Haanna ameen, «Hikki kayooseefa ere la Yesuusayyolla? Aabbokkeessana Aayetteessa la noo okanssoyaanna? Hayya gidda usu misii ‹Ani daruurkko dagera› amara» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43"/>Yesuusana abbaabe haa ame, «Isi isirroo aroo gumggumiteen. <verse eid="JHN 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44"/>In kafarera Odo isi tos goɂabbaabe kuwaarre maayyona in tos emeeyin lakkodaanddaaro in tos kaɂemeetaro aninna tagachchoo arri goyikko keesinara. <verse eid="JHN 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45"/>Kahegeroolnna, ‹dubba Waakko oɂagaalssateen leeraan› amame s'aafamera, Odo kamaalarana usukkona kaɂagaalssatera dubba in tos emeetara.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">Isa. 54:13</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46"/>Waa dollekko kaɂemeetero kuwaarre Odo kaddeera koonna laagiro, Odo kaddeera usu kaalaalya. <verse eid="JHN 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47"/>Ani rumminaa rumminaa amara, kaɂammanara dubba jiruu jiroommakki giri aba. <verse eid="JHN 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48"/>Kagiri babo aniya. <verse eid="JHN 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49"/>Odojjolaalkkisin k'alullattokki ulii babo kadaruure aameen halleewo kuwaarre goyeen. <verse eid="JHN 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50"/>Ayesuun goɂameen ibbaaddo goggogoononkko goggoɂaamiroon daruurkko kadagera babo hikkaya. <verse eid="JHN 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51"/>Daruurkko kadagera arddokki babo aniya; hikka babokko kaɂaamara dubba jiruu jiroomman girara; alamiin giri goggolleeroon ani kasisara babo sooɂootteyaan ame.»<verse eid="JHN 6:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52"/>Ayihuudina, «Goggoɂaaminnoon hikki ibaaddoti soo ootteessa misii sisin daanddaara?» amaa isi isirroo ataayiseen dogamano haggaɂabeen.<verse eid="JHN 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53"/>Yesuusana, «Ani rumminaa rumminaa amara, Ere kaɂibaaddonɂi soo goɂaamanawaatten iigina got'amanawaatten isiɂoottisinuun giri lakkoɂabttaan. <verse eid="JHN 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54"/>Sooɂoottee kaɂaamara, Iigikkeenna kat'amara jiruu jiroommakki giri aba, aninna tagachchoo arri usu goyikko keesinara. <verse eid="JHN 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55"/>Sooɂootti karrummii babo Iigikkina karrummii t'amoya. <verse eid="JHN 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56"/>Sooɂoottee kaɂaamara, Iigikkeenna kat'amara iyyee girara, aninna usu girnnara. <verse eid="JHN 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57"/>Arddokki Odo in goggofareroo, aninna usukko kakkeeyi giri goggogiro malee, kaɂaamarana hikkamalee inkko kakkeeyi giri girara. <verse eid="JHN 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58"/>Daruurkko kadagera babo hikkaya odolaalkkisin kaɂaameran babo aankikki lakkoyo, hassu babo oɂaamaraan adeen goyeeran, hikka babo kaɂaamara ade jiruu jiroomman girara.»<verse eid="JHN 6:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59"/>Hikka kakkoon ayeesera kak'ifirenaahoomi maamanii Ayihuudikokki min kaɂebii agaalssisaa giraanye.<verse eid="JHN 6:59"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiruu jiroommakki kagiri haafura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60"/>Usukko oɂagaalssatarenkko omooggan hikka maaleen, «Hikki kac'c'annak'isiro haafuraya, ayoyya atayin kadaanddaara?» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 6:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61"/>Usukko oɂagaalssatareenna hikka ayeesii gumggumaano Yesuusa issiiwa addeesere, «Hikki isinuun handuddufo leero maana? <verse eid="JHN 6:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62"/>Hayya, Ere kaɂibaaddo t'aye takkogire tos biyaa giraan goddeeten me aminye? <verse eid="JHN 6:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63"/>Ayyaana kawaa giri sisara, soo adeen laɂo toonna lakkoɂabaan, ani isinuun kasegeera haafura ayyaanana girinnaya. <verse eid="JHN 6:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64"/>Halleewo kuwaarre isinkko kaɂammanoon kookkoo gira» ame. Hikkina, Yesuusa ayyoosi ammanoon giraanna ayyo usu roorisi sisinaro t'ayewa mankkokasanaaye maraanya. <verse eid="JHN 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65"/>Horeddeenna, «Odokko gosisame kuwaarre, maayyona in tos emeeyin lakkodaanddaaro ani kakkoon amera hikkanunya» ame.<verse eid="JHN 6:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66"/>Hikkakko kakkeeyi Yesuusakko oɂagaalssatareen omooggan haararttii abbaabateen, esekko abbaabatene debee lakkosesseeten. <verse eid="JHN 6:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67"/>Yesuusana tomonkko lamane, «Isinna addeen seeyin dootaattan?» ame. <verse eid="JHN 6:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68"/>Simoona P'et'iroosana, «Goottakki, ayyo tos seeyinanna? Ati jiruu jiroommakki kagiri haafura abtta. <verse eid="JHN 6:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69"/>Ati koo kawaa k'ulluukki laano gidda ammanenna, addeenssenna» ame abbaabe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:69 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:16">Mat. 16:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:29">Mar. 8:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:20">Luk'. 9:20</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 6:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70"/>Yesuusana abbaabere, «Isin tomonkko lamana kaɂassaabera la aniyolla? Ayesuun goɂameen isinkko koo durrisaya» ame. <verse eid="JHN 6:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71"/>Kaɂask'orotu Simoona ere kayihuuda, tomonkko lamakko koo goleenna, danbene roorisi mankkosisinaro maraan garakkeessa ayeesanoya.<verse eid="JHN 6:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa baala kadaasee takkokabajjaamaro banɂe seete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1"/>Esekko abbaabatere Yesuusa, esee kagire Ayihuudil Yesuusa lagadin mankkodootare maraan, Yihuudakokki awuraajjaayi maraamurano isaagere Galiilaa maraamure. <verse eid="JHN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2"/>Kaɂayihuudi kadaasee baala kakkogabbalamare goorata ade,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:34">Woy. 23:34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:13">Ada. 16:13</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3"/>Abbilaal tayesuusa, «Kukko oɂagaalssatareenna adeen ati ofelatto felo goggodeenawun, hittakko Yihuuda tos see ameen. <verse eid="JHN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4"/>Isi tusayin dootataa giraan siyame kafelara maayyona laagiro. Atina hikka ayees kafelatto golleete, isiɂoottaa alamiin addeesisa» ameen. <verse eid="JHN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5"/>Abbilaaltteessa suure lakkoɂammantette.<verse eid="JHN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6"/>Yesuusana, «Iyyen likkiikki goorata ganaa lakkogeero, isinuun ade maagoreenna gooratana kaɂekkaateya. <verse eid="JHN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7"/>Alami isin diidin lakkodaanddaaro, ani ade, feloɂootteessa omeellan laano mankkoɂatotaaro maraan in diidara. <verse eid="JHN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8"/>Isin baala tos seyeen, iyyeen likkiikki goorata mankkogeennon giro maraan baala tos lakkoseeyinaro ame.» <verse eid="JHN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9"/>Hikka isoon amere Galiilaa adallaate.<verse eid="JHN 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10"/>Halleewo kuwaarre, abbilaal baala tos kakkoseetatte goorata usuna mutaa halleenon giraan siyame baala tos seete. <verse eid="JHN 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11"/>Baala gutiinna Ayihuudi, «Usu ibaaddoti haggee gira?» amaa dootaa gireen. <verse eid="JHN 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12"/>Garakkeessa gosa orroo tanjjiin gumggumaano gire. Kookkoonna, «Usu kaɂidankki ibaaddotiya» ameen. Okkalee adeen, «Laa, gosa kashirsaroya» ameen. <verse eid="JHN 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13"/>Halleewo kuwaarre Ayihuudi absatanokko kakkeeyi garakkeessa futtise kaɂayeese maayyona laagire.<verse eid="JHN 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa tabaala banɂee seete agaalssise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14"/>Baalana takkot'eɂellaa seetee Yesuusa k'ulluukki min kawaa tos beere agaalssisano haggaɂabe. <verse eid="JHN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15"/>Ayihuudina saadaa hikki ibaaddoti haɂagaalssannoonii hikka agaalssis misii addeesin daanddee? Ameen.<verse eid="JHN 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16"/>Yesuusana, «Ani kaɂagaalssisara agaalssisano inkko halleennon giraan in kafarerokko kaɂemeeteroya. <verse eid="JHN 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17"/>Maayyona feɂi tawaa felin godoote, hikki agaalssisi Waakko goorttun inkko kaɂemeetero laano kalebeese kasa. <verse eid="JHN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18"/>Iskko kaɂayeesara, hassu kakkoonfelara ussun kabaja mankkodootataro maraanya, kafarerokotti kabajjaan kafelara ade usu karummiiya, t'arana lakkohelamatto. <verse eid="JHN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19"/>Muse seera lakkosiseroya? Ayesuun goɂameen koonna seera lakkoɂooratteen. Isin mewuun in lagadin dootaattan?»<verse eid="JHN 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20"/>Gosana, «Ati durrisa kaɂabtta!» «Ku ade ayyoya lagadin kadootara?» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21"/>Yesuusa abbaabere isone haa ame, «Ani baasa koo fele, isin dubbana saaddeen. <verse eid="JHN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22"/>Hamas's'isamano kakkoɂemetera odolaalkko kuwaarre Musekko lakkoyo, golleenna Muse hamas's'isamano mankkosise maraan Ayihuudin tafoolssi arrina haɂiisoni yiis hamas'isattan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10">Met'. 17:10</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Woy. 12:3</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23"/>Seera kamuse goggoɂiggilssamonkko yiis Ayihuudin tafoolssi arri kahamas'iisattan golleeten, taɂibaaddoo neefo tafoolssi arri goffayyise mewuun in gutii amaraattan?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:9">Yan. 5:9</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24"/>Bebbeed taɂibaaddo diyaa firddaano isaagaddeen firdda karrummii firddaa» ame.<verse eid="JHN 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa, usu Kiristoosa laano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25"/>Usu goorata Iyyerusaalemi kagire kookkoo ibaaddo; «Lagadin kadootaran ibaaddoti la hikkayyolla? <verse eid="JHN 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26"/>Hikkima usu diidaa beese ayeesara, iso ayees koonna lakkoɂayeesaran, hikki ibaaddoti Kiristoosa laano odonnati oɂabaan addeesi girraane? <verse eid="JHN 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27"/>Hikki ibaaddoti ade eetikko emeetero noo kanssowa, Kiristoosa emeetaa giraan eetikko emeeyinnaro maayyona laakkaso» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28"/>Yesuusa k'ulluukki min kawaa orroo agaalssisaa yaaye t'ok'k'isere, «Ii, in kassaanwa, eetikko emeeyerona kassaanwa, ani hittanii kakkongira isiɂootteeyi lakkoyo, ayesuun goɂameen in kafarera usu karrummiya, isin addeen lakkokassaan, <verse eid="JHN 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29"/>Ani ade usu dollekko mankkoɂemeeyero maraanna usuna in mankkofarero maraan ani usu kasowa» ame.<verse eid="JHN 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30"/>Haanssun abin dooteen, ayesuun goɂameen goorata ganaa mankkogeenoon giro maraan maayyona gene gutii lakkokaye. <verse eid="JHN 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31"/>Golleenna gosakko kamooggan usuu ammanere, «Hayya, Kiristoosa emeetaa hikki ibaaddoti kafelaro malaatakko karoore fello?» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32"/>Farasaawiilnna, gosa garakkeessa gumggumaa kaɂayeesaro ayees malee, katuuk'aamol woyichchaalnna Farasaawiil goggoɂabinawun isoon k'ulluukki min kawaa oɂooraran fareen. <verse eid="JHN 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33"/>Yesuusana, «Ani isin wota kakkoɂadallaayinara goorata kic'c'arunya, esekko in kafarero tos seeyinara, <verse eid="JHN 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34"/>Isin in dootinattaan, ayesuun goɂameen lakkohelnnattaan, ani mankkogiro tos emeeyin lakkodaanddeetan» ame.<verse eid="JHN 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35"/>Ayihuudin odonnati oɂabaan isi isirroo, «Hikka ibaaddoti, helin noo kakkowaayinanna eetirraa seeyin gohediroya? Giriikkijjool orro darɂaameen ogiraan unattaani tos seeyire Giriikkijjool agaalssisin dootereya? <verse eid="JHN 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36"/>‹In dootinattaan, addeen lakkohelnattaan adina, ani mankkogiro tos emeeyin lakkodaanddeetan› goɂamiro me amanoya?» ameen ayeeseen.<verse eid="JHN 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ogiri bekekkokki fultto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37"/>Baalan gudatano tallaatto tanjiinti arrii, Yesuusa aalleere yaaye t'ok'k'isere, «Maayyona kasugubaatera gogire in tos emeeyire hat't'ame ame.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:36">Woy. 23:36</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38"/>Iyye kaɂammanara, mas'aafa k'ulluukki goggoɂamaroo ogiri bekekokki fultto orrokko biyaara» ame iyyee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 47:1">Hiz. 47:1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:8">Zak. 14:8</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39"/>Hikka usu kakkoonɂamera usuu oɂammanaraan kaɂatayinaraan ayyaanakokki garaye, aalantina Yesuusa ganaa mankkokabajjaamoon gire maraan Ayyaana K'ulluukki lakkosisamere.<verse eid="JHN 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gosa orroo kalekalee biyaano lee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40"/>Gosakkona kookkoo hikka haafura kakkomaalare goorata, «Hikki ibaaddoti ogiraan kahegerooya» ame. <verse eid="JHN 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41"/>Okkalee, «Usu Kiristoosaya» Ameen. Kuukina ade haa ame, Kiristoosa Galiilakko «Misii emeeyin daanddaara? <verse eid="JHN 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42"/>Mas'aafa k'ulluukki, Kiristoosa kadaawute hidiidikko, Daawutena takkogire Beteleemikko emeetano la ayeesarolla?» ameen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2 Sam. 7:12</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mik. 5:2</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43"/>Haannunna Yesuusakotti aalanttii gosa orroo kalekalee biyaano lee, <verse eid="JHN 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44"/>Kookkoonna usu abin doote, ayesuun goɂameen maayyona gene gutii lakkokaye.<verse eid="JHN 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayihuudin horehayeen ofelarenkonɂi ammanatanawaatti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45"/>Esekko abbaabatere k'ulluukki min kawaa oɂoorareen tuuk'aamokokki woyichchaal tos abbaabateen emeeten, isona «Muun aati emeennoon isaayiddeettan?» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 7:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46"/>«Ohandaarenna, hikka ibaaddoti aani, maayyona suure ayeese laakkaso» ameen abbaabeen.<verse eid="JHN 7:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47"/>«Farasaawiil ade, isinna sobantteettaan amanoya? <verse eid="JHN 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48"/>Golleenna odonnati oɂabankkona Farasaawilkko usuu kaɂammanera giro? <verse eid="JHN 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49"/>Seera kakkasoon hikki gosa ade kak'anggaameya» ameen abbaabeen.<verse eid="JHN 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50"/>Hittakko horene Yesuusa tos seete kagirena isokko koo kalleera Nik'odimoosa,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:1-2">Yan. 3:1-2</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51"/>«Seerakkaani, horaarjje ibaaddoti koo me felero hamaaloninna haɂaddeesooni firddaara?» ame.<verse eid="JHN 7:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52"/>Isona, «Atina adde Galiilakkotta? Kahegeroo Galiilakko kiwaatti k'ok'k'orina, gachchooggeeta» ameen abbaabeen. <verse eid="JHN 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53"/>[Esekko danbbenne dubba min min seeteen.<verse eid="JHN 7:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Sharmmut'ummaa taɂabanttetto heleelttiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1"/>Yesuusa ade zayitii kabiyaara gaa takkoɂalataro wodami tos bee. <verse eid="JHN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2"/>Tallami arri barbaariinoo k'ulluukki min kawaa orroo ade mute, gosana maraamure kukku ame; agaalssisinna hamas's'ee. <verse eid="JHN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3"/>Seera kamuse oɂagaalssisaranna Farasaawiil sharmmut'umaa taɂabanttetto heleelttiti keneen gosa orroona aalliseen, <verse eid="JHN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4"/>Yesuusane, «Kaɂagaalssisatto, hitti heleelttiti sharmmut'aa abbanttetta, <verse eid="JHN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5"/>Musena, hitta heleelttiti aankkikki eɂemoo goggoɂeeggamiro seeraa ajajeera, ati adde me amatta?» ameen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Woy. 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:22-24">Ada. 22:22-24</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6"/>Hitta hoosin usu kakkonhosateran, usu takkomootiran aalantti dootaa c'aafitiniye, Yesuusa ade hussi amere ferii ul gutii s'aafano haggaɂabe.<verse eid="JHN 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7"/>Hoosiinii kakkojjeerisaren goorata t'ok'k'i amere, «Isin orrokko c'ubbo kallayikki usu t'ayi eɂemoo haɂeegge» ame. <verse eid="JHN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8"/>Adena hussimere ul gutii s'aafe. <verse eid="JHN 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9"/>Iso hikkana kakkomaalaren goorata, jaarsoleekko haggaɂabere toottoolli esekko iiseen seeteen, esee usu horee aalliite tagitte heleelttitine wota Yesuusa kale hese. <verse eid="JHN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10"/>Yesuusana t'ok'k'i amere, «Te heleelttiti; ibaaddo haggerraa seete? Ku gutii kafirddeere laagiroya?» ame.<verse eid="JHN 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11"/>Esena, «Goottakki! Koonna laagiro» antte, Yesuusana, «Aninna lakkofirddinaro, see, goortta hittakko danbbeebaan adi c'ubbo aroofelte» ame.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kahorkkoo kagalbbaa mas'aafajjolnna kahorkkoo mas'aafal 7:53-8:11 geeroon kagiro lakkoɂadaraan; kookkoo Yan. 21:24kko haarre s'aaferaan; kakkalee ade Luk'. 21:38kko haarre s'aaferaan; koo kahorkoo kagalbbaa mas'aafa ade Yan. 7:36kko haarre s'aaferaan </char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Atonnati kayesuusa rummi laano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12"/>Adena Yesuusa ibaaddoon, «Ani kaɂalami ifaya, indebee kasesseetarana kagiri ifa laara kuwaarre suure mugudii lakkosesseetaro» ame.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:14">Mat. 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 9:5">Yan. 9:5</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13"/>Farasaawiilnna, «Ati isiɂoottaawun mankkoɂatotaatto maraan atonnatikka lakkoɂatamaro» ameen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:31">Yan. 5:31</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14"/>Yesuusa, «Ani garakkee goɂatotaayena ani eetikko emeeyerona eetirraa seeyinaro mankkokaso maraan atonnatikki rummiya, isin addeen eetikko emeeyero goorttun eetirraa seeyinaro kakkassaan ayees laagiro. <verse eid="JHN 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15"/>Isin yaada kaɂibaaddo aani firddaattan, ani maayyo gutiinna lakkofirddinaro. <verse eid="JHN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16"/>Gofirddeenna, kafarero odo wota kuwaarre ani kale mankkoginnoon maraan firddakki garaya. <verse eid="JHN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17"/>Ibaaddo lamakki atotaano atamano goggoɂabo malee seerakkisinii s'aafamera. <verse eid="JHN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18"/>Garakkee kaɂatotaatarokko koo aniya; kakkaleenna iin kaɂatotaara in kafarero Odokkeeya ame.» <verse eid="JHN 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19"/>Esekkona, «Aabbokka eetii gira?» ameen. Yesuusana, «Aabbokkeenna leere inna laakkassaan, in kakkassaan leeteenwa, Aabbokkeenna kasattenwa» ame abbaabe.<verse eid="JHN 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20"/>Yesuusa hikka kakkoonɂayeesera k'ulluukki min kawaa orroo, huu kakkokaamaro min dollee agaalssisaa giraanye, halleewo kuwaarre gooratakkeessa ganaa mankkogeennoon giro maraan maayyona usu lakkoɂabero.<verse eid="JHN 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammano waattikokki gara kasisamero seerisano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21"/>Yesuusa adena, «Ani seeyinara, isinna in dootinattaan, c'ubbokkisiniinna goyinattan, ani mankkoseetaro tos adi emeeyin lakkodaanddeetan» ame.<verse eid="JHN 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22"/>Ayihuudin odonnati oɂabanaayenna, «Ani mankkoseetaro isin emeeyin lakkodaanddeetan usu kakkoonɂamera isiɂootteessa lagadayinya?» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23"/>Yesuusa ade, «Isin hegelkkottaan, ani elekkoya, isin hikka alamikkottan, ani lakkohikka alamikkoyo. <verse eid="JHN 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24"/>C'ubbokkisinii gowaano segeera, ani usuya goɂamiro ani usu laano goɂammanatana waatteen, c'ubbokkisinii goyinattan» ame.<verse eid="JHN 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25"/>Isona «Ati ayyotta?» ameen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Yesuusana «Horaarjjewa, kaɂayeesare usu aniye. <verse eid="JHN 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26"/>Ani isin gutii kaɂayeesirona kafirddinnaro kamooggan ayees aba, ayesuun goɂameen in kafarera kaɂabddameya, usukkona kamaalero alamiin ayeesinara.»<verse eid="JHN 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27"/>Isona gara kaɂodoo segaa girano lakkoɂaddeeseeran. <verse eid="JHN 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28"/>Haanssun Yesuusa, «Ere kaɂibaaddo t'ok'k'isi kakkosuyiteen goorata, aankki kaɂamera usu ani laano odo kaɂagaalssisero ayeesano, feɂitteeyi koonna feliwaatti kassaanwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29"/>In kafarera usu inneta gira, maaɂeeki gooratana kageggelaayisiro felin kale in lakkoɂisaagero ame.»<verse eid="JHN 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30"/>Yesuusana hikka goggoɂayeese omooggan usu ammaneen.<verse eid="JHN 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiis kaɂabraame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31"/>Yesuusana usuuyi kaɂammanaro Ayihuudinne, «Isin agaalssisanokkeeyi goɂataatteen rumminaa inkko oɂagaalssaattanttaan ame. <verse eid="JHN 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32"/>Rummina kassanwa, rummina isin balchchumma beesinatta ame.»<verse eid="JHN 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33"/>Isona abbaabeen, «Noo yiis kaɂabraamenna, maayyoonna diyyii leene laakkansso, hayya noonne balchchumma binnattaan misii amatta?» ameen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:9">Mat. 3:9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:8">Luk'. 3:8</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34"/>Yesuusana «Ani rumminaa rumminaa amara c'ubbo kafelara kac'ubbo diyyiiya, <verse eid="JHN 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35"/>Diyyii eerinnawuna ibaaddo kaminee orroo lakkogiraro ere ade maagoreenna minii girara. <verse eid="JHN 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36"/>Goortta Ere kawaa balchchumma gobeese, rumminaa balchchumma binnattaan. <verse eid="JHN 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37"/>Isin yiis kaɂabraame laano ani kasowa ayesuun goɂameen haafurakkee atatana mankkowaattan maraan in lagadin goosatteen keeteettan. <verse eid="JHN 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38"/>Ani Aabbokkee, dollee kaddeero ayeesara, isinna Aabbokkisinkko kamaaltteettaan felattaan ame.»<verse eid="JHN 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39"/>Isona, «Aabbokkaani Abraameya» ameen abbaabeen. Yesuusana «Isin yiis kaɂabraame leeteenwa,» Abraame «kafelero felatteenwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40"/>Waakko maalere rummi kasegeero in lagadin dootaattan Abraame ade hikkamalee lakkofelero. <verse eid="JHN 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41"/>Isin kafelattan Aabbokkisin kafelaroya.» Isona, «Noo sharmmut'ummaa oɂumulaminenno lakkonno,» «Aabbokkaanina koo Waa kaalaaya» ameen abbaabeen.<verse eid="JHN 8:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiis kaddurrisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42"/>Yesuusana, «Waa Aabbokkisin lii girewa, ani Waa dollekko mankkoɂemeeyero maraan geelatattenwa usu in farera kuwaarre ani isiɂootteeyi lakkoɂemeeyero. <verse eid="JHN 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43"/>Ani kaɂayeesaro mewuun shaadanawaattan? Aalanttina haafurakkee maalin mankkodootannon maraanya. <verse eid="JHN 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44"/>Isin Aabbokkisinkki kaddurrisa yiisttaan. Aabbokkisinkki halchcha felin dootaattan. Usu horaarjjewa neefo kalagadaroye, usu dollee rummi mankkoginnoon maraan rummii lakkoɂataatero; usu t'arana kat'araa odo mankkoleewun t'ara ayeesara kaɂayeesarana iskko met't'eereya. <verse eid="JHN 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45"/>Ani ade rummi mankko ayeesaro maraan lakkoɂammanattaan. <verse eid="JHN 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46"/>Isinkko ati c'ubbaalessatta ami mootin kadaanddaara ayyoyya? Rummi kaɂayeesaro gollee, mewuun ammanana waattaan? <verse eid="JHN 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47"/>Kawaa kallee haafura kawaa maalara, isin addeen Waakko mankkolleennon maraan lakkomaalattaan ame.»<verse eid="JHN 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa gara keessa kaɂayeesero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48"/>Ayihuudina abbaabere, «Ati Samaraawitta, adena durrisa ku gutii gira amanokkaan la garayyolla?» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49"/>Yesuusana, «Ani Aabbokkee kabajjaara kuwaarre durrisa lakkoɂabo,» «Isin addeen in yeraasattaan. <verse eid="JHN 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50"/>Ani kabajattee lakkodootataro, kabajattee kadootara ade girowa; kafirddaarana usuya. <verse eid="JHN 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51"/>Ani rumminaa rumminaa amara, maayyona haafurakkee goɂoorate, goyi suure lakkodeero» ame abbaabe.<verse eid="JHN 8:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52"/>Ayihuudina, «Durrisa girano giddaa addeensse, Abraame goyera, kahegeroolnna hikkamaleewa, ati adde maayyona haafurakkaa goɂoorate suure lakkogooro amatta. <verse eid="JHN 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53"/>Ati Aabbokkaani Abraamekko rooratta? Usu goye, ohegeroolna usumaleewwa goyeen, hayya ati ayyoyya amin laatta ameen?» <verse eid="JHN 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54"/>Yesuusana «Ani isiɂoottee gokkabajaaye kabajatti laɂo kalliittitta, kakkabajinarana ade isinne wota, isin Hedokkaani kaɂamattan Aabbokkeeya. <verse eid="JHN 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55"/>Isin gokasanawaatenna ani kasowa laakkaso goɂame, ani ade isin aani kat'araa laara, ani ade kasowa haafurana oorayinara. <verse eid="JHN 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56"/>Aabbokkisin Abraamekokki halchcha arrittee dii geggelaayin dootere, deegurena geggelaate, kageggelaatena lee ame abbaabe.»<verse eid="JHN 8:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57"/>Ayihuudina, «Ganaa gees konttom kakkoleeno,» «Ati Abraame deetetta!» ameen. <verse eid="JHN 8:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58"/>Yesuusana, «Ani rumminaa rumminaa amara» «Abraame umulamanakko horene ani aniya» ame.<verse eid="JHN 8:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59"/>Usu goorata usu eeggiin eɂemo aateen, Yesuusa ade golate, k'ulluukki min kawaakkona bee seete.<verse eid="JHN 8:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Iilɂo baye kaɂumulamero ibaaddoti fayyiise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1"/>Yesuusa raanne rooraa giraan takkoɂumulamekko haggaɂabere Iilɂo kabbayere ibaaddoti dee. <verse eid="JHN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2"/>Usukko oɂagaalssatareenna Yesuusane, «Kaɂagaalssisatto! Hikki ibaaddoti Iilɂo bayi goggoɂumulamiron c'ubbo kafelera ayyoyya? Usuya muu oɂumuleeraanyan?» ameen hoosaten.<verse eid="JHN 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3"/>Yesuusana, «Usu goorttun oɂumuleeraan c'ubbo lakkofeleeran,» «Hikki kakkoonleera ade felo owaa usuu goggomutinaawunya. <verse eid="JHN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4"/>Arri giraan in kafarerokonɂi felo felano dootisara, maayyona felin takkodaanddenon hemeen emaatta, <verse eid="JHN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5"/>Hikka alamii giraan alamikokki ifa aniya ame.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:14">Mat. 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:12">Yan. 8:12</ref>.</char></note>»<verse eid="JHN 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6"/>Hikka ame abbaabatere ulii hanc'c'ufe tufere hanc'c'ufee erre c'awudisere Iilɂo oɂibaaddotii shigidere, <verse eid="JHN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7"/>«Seedde Selihoomi kaɂamamaro eelaa aalina» ame. (Selihoomi amano «Kafarame» amanoya.) Ibaaddotina seete aale. Deenddaanna abbaabate emeete.<verse eid="JHN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8"/>Ollaatteessana hittakko horeene usu ebaataa giraan kaddeera ibaaddo, «Hikki ibaaddoti la hamas's'ee kaɂebaatareyolla?» ameen. <verse eid="JHN 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9"/>Kookkoona, «Ogiraan usuya» Ameen, kuukina usu aani laara kuwaarre lakkoɂusuyyo ameen, usu ade, «Aniwayya» amaa gire. <verse eid="JHN 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10"/>Ibaaddona, «Hayya Iilɂoɂootta misii banameen?» ameen hoosaten. <verse eid="JHN 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11"/>Usuna, «Yesuusa kaɂamaraan ibaaddoti erre c'awudisere Iiilɂoɂootteeyi shigide, Selihoomi tos seeyire goggoɂaalloon segee, seeyeerena aale, diyaanona daanddee» ame abbaabe. <verse eid="JHN 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12"/>Isona, «Hayya, usu ibaaddoti eetii gira?» Ameen. Usuna, «Ani laakkaso» ame.<verse eid="JHN 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Farasaawiil ibaaddoti misii fayyeero k'ulleessaano horeddeen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13"/>Isona Iilɂo baye kagire ibaaddoti Farasaawiil tos geesen. <verse eid="JHN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14"/>Yesuusa c'awudo shigidere Iilɂo oɂibaaddoti kakkobanera Ayihuudin tafoolissi arrite. <verse eid="JHN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15"/>Haanssun Farasaawiil misii diyaano daanddeero hoosaten. Ibaaddotina, «Usu Iilɂoɂootteeyi c'awudo shigide» aninna «Aale hikkima diyaa gira ame.»<verse eid="JHN 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16"/>Farasaawilkko kookkoo, «Hikki ibaaddoti tafoolssi arri mankkokabajiinon maraan, Waakko lakkoyo» Ameen. Kuukina adeen, «C'ubbaaleessa, hikka aankkikki maalaata misii felin daanddaara?» ameen. Isiɂorroonna isiɂaatiwaatti met't'aantte.<verse eid="JHN 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17"/>Haanssun, Iilɂo baye kagire ibaaddoti tos abbaabatereen, «Iilɂoɂoottaa kabanero ibaaddotikokki gara ati me amatta?» ameen. Ibaaddotina, «Usu kahegerooya» ame. <verse eid="JHN 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18"/>Ayihuudina usu oɂumuleeraan tos farigureen taaɂuumissisiraanii ibaaddoti Iilɂo baye kagire laanona adena diyaanokkeessana lakkoɂammanatereen. <verse eid="JHN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19"/>Isona, «Iilɂo baye umulamera kaɂamattaan erekkisin hikkaya? Hayya gidda misii din daanddee?» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20"/>Oɂumuleeraanna, «Erekkaani laanona Iilɂo bayi umulamano kanssowa.»<verse eid="JHN 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21"/>Gidda ade misii diyaano daanddeero Iilɂoɂootteessa maayyo banero noo laakkansso isi kadanddee ibaaddoti mankkollee maraan, isiɂoottessaawun ayeesin daanddaara usu hoosayen ameen abbaabeen. <verse eid="JHN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22"/>Yesuusa, Kiristoosaya ami kaɂatotee dubba min kaɂebi kaɂayihuudikko goggohororamiroo Ayihuudi t'ayeen murittesseen mankkogireen maraan, oɂumuleeraan hikka kakkoonɂameeren Ayihuudi abissateerenya. <verse eid="JHN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23"/>Haanssun oɂumuleeraan usu isi kadaanddee ibaaddoti mankkolleero maraan usu hoosayen ameen.<verse eid="JHN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24"/>Iilɂo kabayere ibaaddotina kallami uumeene, «Ati ibaaddoti, Waa kabajiina,» «Hikki ibaaddoti c'ubbaaleessa laano noo kanssowa» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25"/>Usuna «C'ubbaaleessa laano ani laakkaso ayesuun goɂameen ani Iilɂo baye kagire laanona gidda ade diyaanokkee hikka ayees koo kasa» ame. <verse eid="JHN 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26"/>Isona, «Usu kuun me felera? Iilɂoɂoottaanna misii banera?» ameen hoosateen. <verse eid="JHN 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27"/>Usuna, «Horaa ani isinuun segeera, lakkoc'ak'assettaan, mewuun adi maaln dootaattan? Isinna addeen usukko kaɂagaalssataro liin dootaattan?» ame. <verse eid="JHN 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28"/>Isona, «Ati hikka ibaaddotikko kaɂagaalssaattotta, noo Musekko oɂagaalssatannonna! <verse eid="JHN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29"/>Waa Musene wota ayeesano noo kanssowa, hikki ibaaddoti ade eetikko emeetero suure laakkansso» ameen ayeeseen.<verse eid="JHN 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30"/>Ibaaddotina, «Isin usu eetikko emeetero addeesiwatti kasaadisiroya, halleewo kuwaarre usu Iilɂo oottee banera. <verse eid="JHN 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31"/>Waa kamaalara, usu kaɂabissatarona feɂitteessa kafelaro kuwaarre, c'ubbaalessaal maaliwaatti noo kanssowa. <verse eid="JHN 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32"/>Iilɂo baye kaɂumulamero ibaaddoti Iilɂo kabanera girowa goɂameen, alami aroomet't'aamekko haggaɂabere maayyona maale laakaso. <verse eid="JHN 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33"/>Hikki ibaaddoti Waakko lii waatewa hikka felin lakkodaanddaare ame abbaabe.»<verse eid="JHN 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34"/>Isona, «Maar dubbaa c'ubbo baate kaɂumulantetta, ati noo agaalssisin misii jaabuu tusaatta?» ameen abbaabeen, horooren.<verse eid="JHN 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayyaanakokki jaamannati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35"/>Yesuusana ibaaddoti horooramano maale, usu kakkohelare gooratana, «Ati ere kaɂibaaddoyi ammanatta?» ame. <verse eid="JHN 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36"/>Ibaaddotina, «Goottakki ani usuu goggoɂammannoon usu ayyoyya?» ame hoosate. <verse eid="JHN 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37"/>Yesuusana, «Deetetta, giddana kunne wota kaɂayeesara usuya» ame. <verse eid="JHN 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38"/>Ibaaddotina, «Goottakki ani ammaninnara» ame sagade. <verse eid="JHN 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39"/>Yesuusana, «Odiyaannon goggodeerawun, odiyaaranna goggodiyaannonkko, firddin hikka alami tos emeeyera» ame. <verse eid="JHN 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40"/>Yesuusa wota ogireen Farasaawilkko kookkoo hikka ayees maaleenguren, «Me amanoya? Hayya noonna Iilɂo odiyaannonna amanoya?» ameen. <verse eid="JHN 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41"/>Yesuusana, «Odiyaannon lii gitteenwa isinuun c'ubbo lakkolaare, gidda ade diyaanna mankkoɂamattaan maraan, c'ubbokkisin goggogiroo girnnara» ame.<verse eid="JHN 9:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Kafoofarona Idaadjjolaal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1"/>Esekkona Yesuusa «Ani rumminaa rumminaa amara, awud kaɂidaad tos ufane anleennon giraan banɂe takkaleenne firime katabara kahetarona kasaamaroya. <verse eid="JHN 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2"/>Karrane katabara ade usu idaad kafoofaroya. <verse eid="JHN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3"/>Karra kaɂoorara karra banara, idaadkkeessana yaayetteessa maalara. Idaadkkeessana megekkisooyi uumaa beesinara. <verse eid="JHN 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4"/>Ootteessa olleeran dubba kakkobeese goorata horehaye sesseetara idaandda yaayetteessa mankkokaso maraan debee sesseetara. <verse eid="JHN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5"/>Martti kalleero goɂameen iso yaayetteessa mankkokasoon maraan usukko bak'ataran kuwaarre suure usuu debee lakkosesseetaran» ame.<verse eid="JHN 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6"/>Yesuusa hikka masuussa segee; iso adeen usu me segeero lakkoshaaderan.<verse eid="JHN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7"/>Haanssun Yesuusa kallami, «Ani rumminaa rumminaa amara, kaɂidaadjjool karra aniya. <verse eid="JHN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8"/>Inkko horeene oɂeemeteeren dubba hetona ossaamaraanyan, idaadjjoolnna adeen iso lakkomaaleen. <verse eid="JHN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9"/>Karra aniya, in tosne katabara dubba fayyaara, tabara, biyaara, bobbana helatara. <verse eid="JHN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10"/>Heto hetin, lagadin baasin kaalaawun emaatta, ani ade kakkoon emeeyera duuddotti neefo goggogirttonya ame.»<verse eid="JHN 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11"/>Adena «kaɂidankki kafoofee aniya, kaɂidankki kafoofee neefotteessa idaadjjool maraan roorise sisara. <verse eid="JHN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12"/>Maragadeen kafoofara ade idaadjjool kakkeessa mankkolleenon maraan, hiyyeeyi goɂemeetto idaad iisere bak'atara, hiyyeeyina idaad abatta, darɂaatta. <verse eid="JHN 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13"/>Kakkoonbak'atarana maragadeen kafoofaro mankkollee maraan idaaduun kanenɂeeyissannoniya. <verse eid="JHN 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14"/>Kaɂidankki kafoofee aniya, kakkee kalleero idaad ani kasowa, isona in kasaaniwa. <verse eid="JHN 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15"/>Hikkina odo in goggokaso malee aninna odo goggokaso maleeya, neefotteenna idaadkkee maraan roorisi sisinara. <verse eid="JHN 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16"/>Hikka awudkko kalleennoon kakkalee idaad gira, isona keenano dootisara, isona yaayettee maalaraan, maate toonna leeraan, kafoofenna kooyya.<verse eid="JHN 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17"/>«Ani abbaabi atayin neefottee roorssayi mankkosisinaro maraan Aabbokki in geelaatara. <verse eid="JHN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18"/>Neefottee feɂitteeyi roorisi sisinara kuwaarre inkko maayyona lakkoɂaatiro, roorisi sisininna leere keesin odonnati aba, hikka ajaja kakkoɂatayera Aabbokkeekkoya» ame.<verse eid="JHN 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19"/>Hikka haafurakko kakkeeyi Ayihuudi orroo adena isiɂaatanawaatti met't'aame. <verse eid="JHN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20"/>Isokko omoogganna, «Usu durrisa aba, k'olamera, muun maalattan?» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21"/>Kakkalee ade, «Hikki ayees durrisa kakkogiro ibaaddotikokki ayees lakkoyo, durrisa ilɂo kabaye banin daanddaara?» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammanowaatti kaɂayihuudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22"/>Iyyerusaalemiinna k'ulluukki min kawaakki usubaatanokokki baala lee, gooratana bat't'eesaye, <verse eid="JHN 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23"/>Yesuusana k'ulluukki min kaɂebii Solomooni kakkosesseetarone rooraa gire. <verse eid="JHN 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24"/>Ayihuudina maraamureene, «Hagge taa geetoon wodanattani rereesi kayinatta? Ati gokiristoosatto addeesisi noon segii» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25"/>Yesuusana, «Ani isinuun segeere, isin addeen lakkoɂammanattaan, Aabbokkeekki megee ani ofelara felo garakkee atotaaran. <verse eid="JHN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26"/>Isin addeen idaadkkee mankko laanawaatteewun lakkoɂammanattaan. <verse eid="JHN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27"/>Idaadkki yaayettee maalara, aninna kasowa, isona indebee sesseetanan. <verse eid="JHN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28"/>Ani isinuun jiruu jiroommakki giri sisinara, duuddo lakkobaataan, genetteekkona isin basi aatin kadaanddeera maayyona laagiro. <verse eid="JHN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29"/>Iso iin kasisera Aabbokki dubbaankko roorara, Aabbokkeetti genekko maayyona basi aatin lakkodaanddeero. <verse eid="JHN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30"/>Aninna Odokkina koonna ame.»<verse eid="JHN 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31"/>Ayihuudi Yesuusa adeen eeggiin eɂemo keeseen. <verse eid="JHN 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32"/>Yesuusa ade, «Odo dollekko omooggan ojinjjiin felo oɂidan tusewwa, hayya hikkasikko eekun eegginattan?» ame.<verse eid="JHN 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33"/>Ayihuudina, «No ku kakkoonɂeegginanna, gadeekki ibaaddoti leete giraan, isiɂoottaa Hedo yelattedde Waa mankkohabaartte maraanya kuwaarre oɂidanɂi feloɂoottaawun lakkoyo» ameen abbaabeen.<verse eid="JHN 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34"/>Yesuusana, «Seerakkisinii, ‹Isin waalttaan ame amame lakkos'aafameroya›?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 82:6">Mez. 82:6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35"/>Haafura kawaa okkoonɂemeetero ‹waalttaan› goɂame mas'aafa k'ulluukkina iggilissamin kadaanddaamon gollee. <verse eid="JHN 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36"/>Hayya, ‹Ani ere kawaayya› mankkoɂamero maraan, Odo ussun kale yelatere alami tos kafarero, ati Waa inggaamatta mewuun amattaan? <verse eid="JHN 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37"/>Ani Aabbokkeenɂi felo kafelaro golleennoon arooɂammanatteen. <verse eid="JHN 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38"/>Kafelaro gollee ade in goɂammanatana waatteenna, Odo iin girano aninna Odoon girano addeesinna shaadi goggolleetawun feloɂootteessaa ammana ame abbaabe.» <verse eid="JHN 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39"/>Adena abin dooteen, usu ade genekko beesate.<verse eid="JHN 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40"/>Esekko Yesuusa t'aye Yaannisa takkot'ammak'are, Yorddaanosi gama tos abbaabate, eseenna adallaate.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:28">Yan. 1:28</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41"/>Ibaaddo kamoogganna usu tos emeete, isona, «Yaannisa koonna malaata lakkofelero, ayesuun goɂameen hikka ibaaddotikki gara kaɂayeesera dubba rummiya» ameen. <verse eid="JHN 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42"/>Ese banɂe omooggan Yesuusaa ammaneen.<verse eid="JHN 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Goyi kaɂalaazari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1"/>Kamayiraamena abbattiseekki kamaartta maamani Bitaanyaayi kagire Alaazari hawɂaamaa gire. <verse eid="JHN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2"/>Hitti abbikkise Alaazari takkoon hawɂaamare Mayiraame, Goottaa gutii shittoo kibttedde lukkitteessa metekkiseeyi tashaakkaratetta. <verse eid="JHN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3"/>Abbalaal lama, «Goottaa; ati kageelaatta ibaaddoti hawɂamara» ameen handdaa fareen.<verse eid="JHN 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4"/>Yesuusa hikka kakkomaalare goorata, «Hikki hawɂaami Ere kawaa usu goggokabajaamironna kabaja tawaawunya kuwaarre goyiin kageegisiro lakkoyo» ame.<verse eid="JHN 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5"/>Yesuusana Maartana, abbatisee Mayiraamena abbikkisoo Alaazari geelataa gire. <verse eid="JHN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6"/>Golleenna kaɂalazaari hawɂaamano maale giraan takkogire banɂee arriti lama haye. <verse eid="JHN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7"/>Esekko abbaabatere usukko oɂagaalssataranne «Ul kayihuuda tos abbaabana» ame.<verse eid="JHN 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8"/>Usukko oɂagaalssataranna, «Kaɂagaalssisatto, arri tic'c'arkko horeene Ayihuudi ku eɂemoo eeggiin dootaa gire, adena eserraa seeyinatta?» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9"/>Yesuusana «Arri too la saatii tomonkko lammattola? Hikka alamikokki ifakko kakkeeyi mankkodiyaaro maraan arrii kasessetara lakkohanduddufataro. <verse eid="JHN 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10"/>Kahanduddufatarana ade hemeen kasesseetaroya, aalanttina ifa lakkoɂabo ame abbaabe.» <verse eid="JHN 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11"/>Hikka segee abbaabatere, «Noo kageelaattanna Alaazari huddurera, aninna huddurokko usu keesin seeyinara» ame.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dimoosa: lakku amanoya.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12"/>Yesuusakko oɂagaalssatareen «Gootta! Gohudurero fayyirowa» ameen. <verse eid="JHN 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13"/>Yesuusa hikka kakkoseegera kaɂalazaari goyikokki garaye, usukko oɂagaalssatareen adeen hudduranokokki gara kaɂayeesero aani leera. <verse eid="JHN 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14"/>Haanssun Yesuusa addeesise, «Alaazari goyera. <verse eid="JHN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15"/>Isin goggoɂammanttaanun, esee giriwaattikki isin maraan geggelaayisara, gidda adi usu tos seenna.»<verse eid="JHN 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16"/>Esekkona Didimoosa kaɂamamare Toomaasa okkalee Yesuusakko oɂagaalssatareen, «Noonna seeyinne usune wota goonna» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa abbalaal taɂalaazari goggoɂisano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17"/>Yesuusa eserraa kakkogiyaare goorata Alaazari gok'amalamesikko arri afar leetette. <verse eid="JHN 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18"/>Bitaanya Iyyerusaalemikko kilo metira seed gitakki fakkintte gitte. <verse eid="JHN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19"/>Kamooggan Ayihuudina Maartana Mayiraamena abbikkisokki goyii goggoɂisin emeeten gireen.<verse eid="JHN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20"/>Maartta Yesuusakokki emeetano maaltedde k'op'ayin beete, Mayiraame adde min hesse gitte. <verse eid="JHN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21"/>Maartana Yesuusane, «Gootta! Ati hittanii gittewa, abbikki lakkogowaare. <verse eid="JHN 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22"/>Gidda gollee kaɂebaatto dubba Waa sisano kasowa antte.»<verse eid="JHN 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23"/>Yesuusana, «Abbikka goyikko kinnara» ame. <verse eid="JHN 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24"/>Maartana, «Tagachchoo arrii goyikko kakkinnara ani kasowa» antte. <verse eid="JHN 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25"/>Yesuusana; «Goyikko kiyaanona neefona aniya, iyyee kaɂammanara goggoyena neefo girara. <verse eid="JHN 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26"/>Iyyee kagira, kaɂammanarana suure lakkogooro, hikka ammanatta?» ame.<verse eid="JHN 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27"/>Esena, «Ii Goottakki, ati alami tos kaɂemaatto Kiristoosa Ere kawaa laano ammanara» antte.<verse eid="JHN 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28"/>Maartta hikka antte abbaabattedde, abbatisee Mayiraame kale uunttede, «Kaɂagaalssisara emeetera, ku uumara» antte. <verse eid="JHN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29"/>Mayiraamena hikka goggomaalttee saantte keetedde Yesuusa tos seette. <verse eid="JHN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30"/>Usu goorata Yesuusa, Maartta usu takkok'op'attetto banɂe gire kuwaarre, ganaa maaman tos lakkotabere. <verse eid="JHN 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31"/>Mayiraame goggoɂisaa min orroo ogireen Ayihuudina, firimi biyaano deenee, k'amal tos seette kaɂowatto aani leere debee been.<verse eid="JHN 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32"/>Mayiraamena Yesuusa mankkogiro banɂe tos geete goggodeeteenna, lukii hegelii iitedde, «Goottakki, ati hittanii kagitte leetewa, abbikki lakkogowaare» antte.<verse eid="JHN 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33"/>Yesuusana ese ootaa giraan, debee kaɂemeetera Ayihuudina ootaa giraan deegure ayyaana gaddaa shaalagamere, <verse eid="JHN 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34"/>«Haggee k'amalitteettaan?» ame hoosate, isona, «Goottakki, koyi deena» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35"/>Yesuusana ilmmi beesate. <verse eid="JHN 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36"/>Ayihuudina, «Misii usu geelataa gire deetene!» ame.<verse eid="JHN 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37"/>Isokko kookkoo ade, «Ilɂo kabayere ilɂo kabanara, hikki ibaaddoti goggogoononkko usu yelin lakkodaanddaareya?» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Alaazari goyikko keesano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38"/>Yesuusa wodanatteessa kallami gaddaa dinanttedde k'amali tos seete, k'amalkkeessana eɂemo kac'ufamero lagaye. <verse eid="JHN 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39"/>Usuna, «Eɂemo keesa» ame. Kagoyerekotti abba Maartta, «Gootta! Usu goyere arri afar mankkoɂadallaatero maraan gidda urmmaatara» antte. <verse eid="JHN 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40"/>Yesuusana, «Ati goɂammanatte kabajja tawaa gachoo deeta ame ani kuun lakkosegeereya?» ame. <verse eid="JHN 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41"/>Haanssun ibaaddo eɂemo keese, Yesuusana elddee deere, «Aabbokki, mankkomaaltte maraan ani ku galataara, <verse eid="JHN 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42"/>Arri dubba ati in maalano ani kasowa hikka ayeesano ade hittanii kaɂaalleera ibaaddona ati in farano goggoɂammannaawun amereya» ame. <verse eid="JHN 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43"/>Yesuusa hikka ame abbaabatere yaaye t'ok'k'iɂisere, «Alaazari, koyi been!» ame uume. <verse eid="JHN 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44"/>Kagoyere Alaazarina genenna lukkiina tamammarantte gashenne wota, bebbeediinna hoc'c'oo goggomammaranttee bee. Yesuusana «Gashe tak'amal furaddeen isaaga haseete» ame.<verse eid="JHN 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa lagadin ofelameraan felo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat. 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar. 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk'. 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45"/>Haanssun Mayiraame tos kaɂemeetere Ayihuudikko kamooggan ibaaddo, Yesuusa ofelero felo deegure usuu ammane. <verse eid="JHN 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46"/>Kookkoona ade seeteerene Yesuusa kafelero Farasaawilun seegeen. <verse eid="JHN 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47"/>Esekko katuuk'aamol woyichchaalnna Farasaawiil taɂayihuudi songoonii kukkuyisenguren haa ameen, «Hikki ibaaddoti kamooggan malaata felaa mankkogiro maraan noo me goyelne iidira? <verse eid="JHN 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48"/>Adda no goɂiinsse ibaaddo dubba usu ammaninara, karoomi ibaaddona emeeyire ulkkaanina gosakkaani baasinara ameen.»<verse eid="JHN 11:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49"/>Isokkona koo usu geesii tuuk'aamon woyichcha kalleera K'eyaafa, «Isin koonna laakkasaan! <verse eid="JHN 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50"/>Gosa dubba kabaarokko gosa maraan odo koo goggoye isinuun kaɂidan laano lakkoshaadattaan? Ame.» <verse eid="JHN 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51"/>Hikka kaɂamera iskko lakkoye, ayesuun goɂameen usu geesii usu tuuk'aamon woyichcha mankkolleere maraan, Yesuusa gosaan kagoyinaro laano hinɂa hegero ayeesanoya. <verse eid="JHN 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52"/>Usu kakkoongowara gosa kaalaawun halleenon giraan kadarɂamero yiis kawaa raattoo kukkuyisinya.<verse eid="JHN 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53"/>Ese arrikko haggaɂabereen Yesuusa lagadin makkareen. <verse eid="JHN 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54"/>Haanssun Yesuusa esekko abbaabatere Ayihuudi orroo diidaa bee lakkosesseetero, ayesuun goɂameen ul k'alullattokki dollee tagitto Efireemi kaɂamamaro maaman tos seetere eseenna usukko oɂagaalssatareene wota addallaate.<verse eid="JHN 11:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55"/>Kaɂayihuudi faasikkaa goggogabbalamee, baala giyaanokko horeene kamuc'c'imano seera felin omooggan ul ulkko Iyyerusaalemi tos been. <verse eid="JHN 11:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56"/>Yesuusana dootaa gireen, k'ulluukki min kawaayi aalleene, «Meɂaani laara? Baalan suure lakkoɂemeeroya?» amaa isiɂisi hoosaten. <verse eid="JHN 11:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57"/>Katuk'aamo woyichchaalnna Farasaawiil ade Yesuusa abin eetii giro kakkasa ibaaddo goggotusironna goggoɂabroon ajajeen gireen.<verse eid="JHN 11:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Bitaanyaayi shittoo shigidamano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat. 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mar. 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:37-39">Luk'. 7:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1"/>Kafaasikkaa baalawun arri lewo hesaa Yesuusa, goyikko kakkeesera Alaazari mankkogiro Bitaanya tos seete. <verse eid="JHN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2"/>Eseenna Yesuusaan kita kahemeenee ekkaasen, Maartta gohandayito, Alaazari usune wota babo aamin kahamas'eerokko kooyye. <verse eid="JHN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3"/>Mayiraamena dookki awɂallo talleete liitiroo mina tamuc'c'intte tanardoosa shittoo keenttedde luki tayesuusaa gutii kibtte, lukkitteessana metekkiseeyi shakaartte, minna shittookotti urtii ammagame.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:37-38">Luk'. 7:37-38</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4"/>Yesuusakko oɂagaalssatarankko koo danbbenne roorise kasisera kaɂask'orotu Yihuuda ade neebaataa, <verse eid="JHN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5"/>«Hitti shittoo seed boolee t'agaraawun daddalamidde maragadena hiyyeessan muun sisiwaatte?» ame.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Diinaara: felate kabbaraaroon arri tookki daamoozaya</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6"/>Hikka kakkoonɂayyeesera kamaragade shile kaɂabare mankkollee maraan kakkaamaro maragadekko ussun atate kahaare heto mankkolleewun kuwaarre hiyyeessan mararere lakkoye.<verse eid="JHN 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7"/>Yesuusaan, «Hitti shittoo tak'amal arriwuun kayelttetto ekkaasano mankkollee maraan isaaga. <verse eid="JHN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8"/>Hiyyeessal maagoreenna isin wota giraan, in addeen arri dubba lakkohelnnattaan,» ame.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Ada. 15:11</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9"/>Usu goorata kamooggan kaɂayihuudi ibaaddo Yesuusa esee girano addeeseren usu tos emeeten, oɂemeeteraanna Yesuusa kaalaa ameen halleenon giraan, usu goyikko kakkeesero Alaazarina diinyya. <verse eid="JHN 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10"/>Haanssun Tuuk'aamokokki woyichchaal adeen Alaazari lagadin makkareen. <verse eid="JHN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11"/>Hikkina aalantti teessaa kamooggan kaɂayihuudi ibaaddo Yesuusa tos seeteere ammanaa mankkogire maraanya.<verse eid="JHN 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa kabajaa Iyyerusaalemi tos tabano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:4-9">Mat. 21:4-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:7-10">Mar. 11:7-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk'. 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12"/>Babbarinssa baalan kaɂemeetara gosa kamooggan Yesuusa Iyyerusaalemi tos emeetaa girano maaleen, <verse eid="JHN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13"/>baalallo ozanbabaa abeen k'op'ayin been, Yaayettisona t'ok'k'iseene, «Hoosaɂina!» «Mege kagoottayi kaɂemeetara kasommaasameya!» «Wono kaɂisiraɂeel kasommaasameya!» ameen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25-26">Mez. 118:25-26</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14"/>Yesuusana darmmee tademeer helatere hamas's'ee, haa amamena goggos'aafameroo,<verse eid="JHN 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15"/>«Ere kas'iyoni arooɂabssatte!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Hikkima wonokka darmmee tademeer hamas's'eere emeetara»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Amameen os'aafameraan hegero goggogudarawunya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zak. 9:9</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16"/>Yesuusakko oɂagaalssataranna hikka dubba horaarjje lakkoshaaderen, usu maraan kas'aafamerana usuna ofelamereen felo kakkoɂaddeeseraan Yesuusa kabajjaame kakkoɂabbaabatare goorataya.<verse eid="JHN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17"/>Yesuusa Alaazari gumbbikko uumegure goyikko kakkokeesere goorata, usune wota kagire ibaaddo dubba goyikko kiyaanokkeessa atotaa gire. <verse eid="JHN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18"/>Ibaaddo kamooggan usu hikka baasakki malaata felano mankkomaalere maraan k'op'ayin bee. <verse eid="JHN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19"/>Haanssunna kafarasaawil ibaaddo isiɂisiɂorroo, «Goorta me yelano dootisara? Deetene! Alami dubba mina abbaabate usu debee sesseetera» isiɂorroo ameen.<verse eid="JHN 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa goyikkeessa t'aye ayeese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20"/>Hedoyisayiin baala tos obeeraan orrokko kagirikki ibaaddona gire. <verse eid="JHN 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21"/>Isona Galiila tagitto Beetesayidakko kalleero ibaaddoti, Filp'oosa tos emeetene, «Gootta,» maganne, «Noo Yesuusa din dootanna» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22"/>Filp'oosana, Indiraasaan segin seete, Indiraasana Filp'oosana seeterene Yesuusaan segeen.<verse eid="JHN 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23"/>Yesuusana, «Ere kaɂibaaddo takkokabajaaminara saatii geetetta. <verse eid="JHN 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24"/>Ani rumminaa rumminaa amara, il taddargammaa erree gutii iide goggoonnon kale hesata, goggoote ade il tamooggan sisatta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat. 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mar. 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luk'. 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">17:33</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25"/>Neefotteessa kageelaatara waatara hikka alamiin neefotteessa kadiidara ade jiruu jiroommakki giri usu ooratara. <verse eid="JHN 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26"/>Iyyeen handayin kadootara gogire indebee hasesseete, aninna mankkogiroo iin kahandaarana esee girnnara iin kahandaarona Aabbokki kabajjirowa.<verse eid="JHN 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27"/>«Gidda neefotti c'annak'aanttetta me amira? ‹Aabbokki hitta saatikko in haasi amu›? Halleewo kakkoonɂemeeyera hitta saatiiwunya. <verse eid="JHN 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28"/>Aabbokki! Megekkaa kabajjii» ame.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Esekko abbaabatere, «Megekkeenna kabajaayera, adina kabajinara» taɂamatta yaaye daruurkko emeette. <verse eid="JHN 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29"/>Esee aallee kagire kamooggan ibaaddo yaaye kakkomaalare goorata, «Huruuntta» ame; kakkalee ade, «Erggichchaya kaɂayeesara» ame.<verse eid="JHN 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30"/>Yesuusa, «Hitti yaaye kakkoonɂemeettetta in maraan halleenon giraan isin maraanya, <verse eid="JHN 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31"/>Hikki alami kakkofirddaaminara goorata giddaaya, hikka alamkokki mootii gidda sarddi shafaminara. <verse eid="JHN 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32"/>Ani ade ulkko t'ok'k'i t'ok'k'i kakkoɂame goorata ibaaddo dubba in tos kukkuyisinara.» ame. <verse eid="JHN 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33"/>Hikka kakkoonɂayeesera misikki goyi goyinaro tusinye.<verse eid="JHN 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34"/>Gosana, «Noo Kiristoosa jiruu jiroommaan girano seerakko maalnenna, hayya, ‹Ere kaɂibaaddo t'ok'k'i t'ok'k'i amano dootisara misii amatta›? Hikki ‹Ere kaɂibaaddo ayyoyya›?» ameen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Mez. 110:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Isa. 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:25">Hiz. 37:25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:14">Dan. 7:14</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35"/>Yesuusana, «Goortanu goorata kic'c'arun ifa abittaan, mugud haɂemennon giraan, ifa giraan sesseeyen, mugud kasesseetara eetirraa seetaro laakkaso. <verse eid="JHN 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36"/>Yiis kaɂifa goggolleetawun ifa girantuun hikka ifaa ammana.» ame. Yesuusa hikka ayeese goggogudisee kale bee golate.<verse eid="JHN 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayihuudi ammano waattii ataatano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37"/>Yesuusa hikka malaata dubba iso horee gofelena suure giddana lakkoɂammanateraan. <verse eid="JHN 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38"/>Hikkina kahegeroo Isiyaasa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">«Goottakki atonnatikkaani ayyoya kaɂammane?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">kagoottaa hunnana ayyoon mute?»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 12:38">kaɂamamera haafura goggogudaroonya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Isa. 53:1</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39"/>Haanssun ammanin lakkodaanddeeran, hikkina Isiyaasa banɂe takkaleeyi haa ame goggoɂayeeseroya.<verse eid="JHN 12:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40"/>«Ilɂoɂoottisooyi goggodiyaannonkko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">wodanattisooyinna goggoshaadonkko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">abbaabayinna goggofayyinonkko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">Waa Iilɂoɂoottisoo baasera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">wodanattisoonna duudisera.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:10">Isa. 6:10</ref>.</char></note>»<verse eid="JHN 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41"/>Isiyaasa hikka kakkoonɂamera kabajatteessa mankkodeero maraanya, garakkeessana ayeese.<verse eid="JHN 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42"/>Golleenna, kaɂayihuudi woyichchaalkkona kamooggan usuu ammane, halleewo kuwaarre Farasaawiil Ayihuudikokki min kaɂebikko iso goggobeesonkko abssateeren ammananokisoo beeseen lakkosegaateren. <verse eid="JHN 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43"/>Hikkina kakkonlleera Waakko taɂemaatto kabajakko roorssateen ibaaddo dollekko taɂemaatto kabaja mankkogeelaaten maraanya.<verse eid="JHN 12:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44"/>Esekkona Yesuusa yaaye t'ok'k'isere, «Maayyona iyyee goɂammane in kaalaalii halleennoon giraan in kafareroona ammanara. <verse eid="JHN 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45"/>In kadiyaara in kafarero diyaara. <verse eid="JHN 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46"/>Iyyee kaɂammane mugudii goggogiroonkko ifallee alami tos emeeyera.<verse eid="JHN 12:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47"/>«Haafurakkee maalire kaɂoorannoo gutii kafirddinara lakkoɂaniyyo, ani alami fayyiisin kuwaarre alami gutii firddin lakkoɂemeeyero. <verse eid="JHN 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48"/>In kaɂatannoonna haafurakkee kayeraasaroo gutii ani kakkofirddinaro aba, ani kaɂayeesera haafura usuwa tagachchoo arri firddinara, aalantina <verse eid="JHN 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49"/>Ani iskko lakkoɂayeesaro ayesuun goɂameen in kafarera Odo me ayeesinarona misii ayeesinaro ajajeera. <verse eid="JHN 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50"/>Ajajakeessa jiruu jiroommakki giri laano kasowa, haanssun ani kaɂayeesara dubba Odo kasegeero kaalaaya ame abbaabe.»<verse eid="JHN 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa usukko oɂagaalssatareen luk'k'aa aalise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1"/>Gooratana kafaasikkaa baalakko horenne gire, Yesuusana hikka alami iisere Odo tos kakkoseeyinara goorata giyaano addeesere, alami ogireen ootteessa olleeraan geelatera, taagachcho geeronna geelate.<verse eid="JHN 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2"/>Kita kahemeene horee roore giraan, Yesuusa roorisi goggosisiroon daabloosa ere kasimoona kaɂask'orotu Yihuuda wodana kekkeese gire. <verse eid="JHN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3"/>Yesuusana, Odo ayees dubba odonnatikkeesa hegelii goggoyeleroo, Waakko faramanona Waa tos abbaabatanokkeessa addeesere, <verse eid="JHN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4"/>Kita kahemeenekko kee, sarssi kayegure mooɂinna hoc'c'o mowaate. <verse eid="JHN 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5"/>Esekkona kakkoɂaalisaran huuyi beke kibere usukko oɂagaalssatareenkonɂi luk'k'a aalisaa tamuwaatero hoc'c'oo shakaarano haggaɂabe. <verse eid="JHN 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6"/>Simoona P'et'iroosa tos emeete, P'et'iroosana, «Goottakki, ati lok'ak'k'oɂootte aalisinatta?» ame. <verse eid="JHN 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7"/>Yesuusana abbaabere, «Ani kafelaro ati gidda laakkasso, haarre adi shaaddowa» ame. <verse eid="JHN 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8"/>P'et'iroosana, «Laa ati lok'k'aɂootte inkko suure lakkoɂaalisso ame. Yesuusana ani ku goɂaalisanawaaye ati inne wota esella lakkoɂabtto» ame. <verse eid="JHN 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9"/>Simoona P'et'iroosana, «Goottakki» goorttanun «Lok'ak'k'oɂootte oolaal anlleenon giraan genetteenna metekkeenna aalisina ame.» <verse eid="JHN 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10"/>Yesuusana, «Maar kaɂaalero ibaaddotiin kadootisara lok'ak'k'o oolaal aalanoya; kahesera maar ade kamuc'c'imeya. Dubbana gollaanawaatteenna isin omuc'intteenttan» ame. <verse eid="JHN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11"/>Isin dubbana omuc'intteen lakkottan usu kakkonɂamera usu roorisi kasisinara ayyoyo mankkokaso maraanye.<verse eid="JHN 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12"/>Lok'ak'oɂoottisoo aalise abbaabatere, huu sarssate abbaabatere banɂee hamas's'eere, haanna ame, «Ani isinuun kafelero shaadattaan<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:27">Luk'. 22:27</ref>.</char></note>?» <verse eid="JHN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13"/>«Isin, in ‹Kaɂagaalssisarona› ‹Gootta› amattaan, garaya, goggoɂamattaani usumaleewwaya. <verse eid="JHN 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14"/>Goortta ani Goottakkisinna kaɂagaalssisaro lee giraan lok'ak'k'oɂoottisin goɂaalise, isinna hikkamalee isiɂisirroo lok'ak'k'oɂoottisin aalssayiin dootisara. <verse eid="JHN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15"/>Ani goggofelerokki malee isinna hikkamaleewa goggofelttaanun masuussaa segeera. <verse eid="JHN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16"/>Ani rumminaa rumminaa amara, kahandaara goottakko, kafaramerana kafarerokko lakkorooraro.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mat. 10:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luk'. 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">Yan. 15:20</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17"/>Goortta hikka ayees addeesiddeene felooyi gohayisseen osommaasantteenttan.<verse eid="JHN 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa roori sisamano ayeese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18"/>«Isin dubbaan ayeesano lakkoyo, oɂassaabero kasowa, ayesuun goɂameen, ‹Babokkee iinne wota kaɂebsatera diina lee kee kaɂamara mas'aafa k'ulluukkikokki haafura goggogudaroonya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Mez. 41:9</ref>.</char></note>›<verse eid="JHN 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19"/>«Kakkogudate goorata ani laano goggoɂammanttaanun, hikki laanokko horene gidda segeera. <verse eid="JHN 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20"/>Ani rumminaa rumminaa amara, ani kafarero kaɂatatara in atatara, in kaɂatatena kafarero atatara.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat. 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mar. 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luk'. 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">10:16</ref>.</char></note>»<verse eid="JHN 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21"/>Hikka ame abbaabatere Yesuusa ayyaana shaalagamere, «Ani rumminaa rumminaa amara, isin orrokko koo in roorisi sisinara» ame addeesise segee.<verse eid="JHN 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22"/>Yesuusakko oɂagaalssatareen usu ayyo amero girddi ameeren isiɂisirroo isiɂisii diyaaten. <verse eid="JHN 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23"/>Isokko koo, Yesuusa kageelaatare usukko kaɂagaalssatare Yesuusaa dollee gabbalame hamas's'ee gire. <verse eid="JHN 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24"/>Simoona P'et'iroosana hikka usukko kaɂagaalssataren malaata tusere «Maayyo amaro hoosa» ame.<verse eid="JHN 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25"/>Usuna geegiyo tayesuusaa gabbalamere, «Goottakki, ku roorisi kasisinara ayyoyya?» ame hoosate.<verse eid="JHN 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26"/>Yesuusana «Hikka babo tuwano koo kaneɂaamiraneta eeggere kakkoonsisara usuya» ame. Esekkona babo kaneɂaamiraneta eeggere ere kasimoona kaɂask'orotu Yihuuda tuyise. <verse eid="JHN 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27"/>Yihuudana babo tuwano koo goggotuwatee goorsewa s'alaye tabtte. Yesuusana,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:27">«Kafelnnatto saami feli» ame. <verse eid="JHN 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28"/>Halleewo kuwaarre Yesuusa mewuun haa amero aamin ohamas's'eeraankko maayyona lakkoɂaddeesero. <verse eid="JHN 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29"/>Yihuuda maragade kaɂabare mankkollee maraan baalan kadootisaro kooko goggoɂiminnoon goorttun hiyyeessaan goggosisiroo Yesuusa kaɂayeesero aani leera.<verse eid="JHN 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30"/>Yihuudana usu babo tuwano koo goggotuwatee bee seete gooratana hemeenye.<verse eid="JHN 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">P'et'iroosakokki kakatano Yesuusa ayeese</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:33-35">Mat. 26:33-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:29-31">Mar. 14:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:33-34">Luk'. 22:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31"/>Yihuuda kakkobeeboware goorata, Yesuusa haa ame «Gidda Ere kaɂibaaddo kabajaamewa usuuyina Waa kabajaamewa. <verse eid="JHN 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32"/>Goortta Waa usuuyi gokabajaame, Waa Erekkeessa issii kabajaatara, goorsewa kabajinara.<verse eid="JHN 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33"/>«Yiiskkee, isin wota kakkoɂadallaayinara goorata kic'c'arunya, isinna in dootinattaan, Ayihuudine, ani mankkoseetaro emeeyin lakkodaanddeetan isoon goggoɂameroo, giddana isinuun hikkawa amara.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:34">Yan. 7:34</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34"/>«Ajaja kaɂusub sisinara, hikkina isiɂisirroo goggogeelattawunya, goortta ani goggogeelayero malee isinna isiɂisirroo geelayene.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:12">Yan. 15:12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 17">17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:23">1 Yan. 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="2JN 1:5">2 Yan. 5</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35"/>Isin isiɂisirroo isiɂisii gogeelatteen, ibaaddo dubba isin ootte inkko oɂagaalssattaan laano hikkanii addeesinara.»<verse eid="JHN 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36"/>Simoona P'et'iroosa, «Goottakki haggerraa seeyinatta?» ame. Yesuusana, «Ani mankkoseetaro gidda debee seeyin lakkodaanddeeto; haarre adi indebee sesseettowa ame abbaabe.»<verse eid="JHN 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37"/>P'et'iroosana, «Goottakki, gidda ani ku debee sesseetana kakkoonwaatara mewuunya? Ku maraan neefottee golleetena roorssayi sisayinara» ame.<verse eid="JHN 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38"/>Yesuusana, «Ogiraan neefotta iyyeen roorisi sisinatta? Ani rumminaa rumminaa amara, lukkale haɂoyinnon giraan seed gali in kakayinatta.» ame abbaabe.<verse eid="JHN 13:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa usukko oɂagaalssatareen ataayise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1"/>«Wodanattisin arooc'annak'amo, Waayi ammana, iinna ada ammana. <verse eid="JHN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2"/>Aabbokkeekki minii minjjool kamooggan kagira, hikki liwaatewa ani segarewa, kakkoonseeyinara banɂe ekkaasinya. <verse eid="JHN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3"/>Ani seeyirena banɂe kakkoɂekkaase goorata, ani mankkogiroo isinna inne wota goggogirttaawun isin aatin kallami emeeyinara. <verse eid="JHN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4"/>Ani kakkoseetara raa maaɂeekkiyo isin kassaanwa.»<verse eid="JHN 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Odo tos kageesaro raa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5"/>Toomaasana, «Goottakki, eetirraa siyaatto laakkansso, hayya, raa misii addeesin daanddaana?» ame. <verse eid="JHN 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6"/>Yesuusana, «Raa aniyya, rummina girina aniwayya, garakkeenne gollee kuwaarre Odo tos kaɂemeetara laagiro. <verse eid="JHN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7"/>In kakkassaan leeteenwa Aabbokkeenna addeesattenwa, giddakko haggaɂabiddeene adi addeessanwa, deetettaan.» ame.<verse eid="JHN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8"/>Filp'oosana, «Goottakki, Odo tusina noon leera» ame. <verse eid="JHN 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9"/>Yesuusana, «Filp'oosa! Gidda gin ani isinne wota gogirro in laakkassoya? In kaddee Odo deera, misii noon ‹Odo tusi amatta›? <verse eid="JHN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10"/>Ani Odoo goggogiro malee, Odona iyyee girano lakkoɂammanattoya? Ani isinuun kasegeera haafura iskko lakkoyo, ayesuun goɂameen felo kafelara iyyee kagiro Odoya. <verse eid="JHN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11"/>Ani Odoo goggogiro malee Odona iyyee goggogiro malee ani isinuun kasegaaro ammana, kakkalee gohesena felo ootteessaa ammana. <verse eid="JHN 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12"/>Ani rumminaa rumminaa amara, iyyee kaɂammanara ani ofelaro felo felara, hikkina ade ani Odo tos mankkoseeyinaro maraan, hikkakko karoore felinnattaan. <verse eid="JHN 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13"/>Odo Eree goggokabajaamiro, megekkeeyi kaɂebaattan dubba felinara. <verse eid="JHN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14"/>Maamisikki ayeesina megekkeeyi goɂebaatteen, ani felinara.<verse eid="JHN 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayyaana K'ulluukki maraan tasisantetto abddi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15"/>«Gogeelatteen ajajakkee oorayinattan. <verse eid="JHN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16"/>Ani Odo ebaayinara, usuna isin wota jiruu jiroommaan kagirro kakkalee kagoggoɂisiro sisinara. <verse eid="JHN 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17"/>Usuna Ayyaana K'ulluukkiya, alami mankkodeennon maraaninna mankkokasoon maraan atayin lakkodaanddaaro, isin addeen, isin wota mankkogirnaro maraanna isin orroo mankkollinnaro maraan kassaanwa. <verse eid="JHN 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18"/>Odo kallayikki yiis aani ani isin lakkoɂiisinnaro, isin tos emeeyinara. <verse eid="JHN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19"/>Goorata kic'c'arkko abbaabayi, alami suure in lakkodinnaro, isin addeen dinnattaan, ani arddokki mankkollee maraan isinna arddonɂi linnattaan. <verse eid="JHN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20"/>Ani Aabbokkeeyi goggogiro malee, isinna iyyee goggogittaan malee, aninna ade isinii goggogiro malee ese arri addeesinattaan. <verse eid="JHN 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21"/>In kageelaatara ajajakkee kaɂoorataroya, kageelaatarona Aabbokki geelaatara, aninna geelaatara, isiɂootteenna tusinara.»<verse eid="JHN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22"/>Esekkona kaɂask'orotu kalleenon Yihuuda, «Goottakki, hayya, alamiin halleennon giraan isiɂoottaa noyyeen kakkotusinatta misiiya?» ame.<verse eid="JHN 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23"/>Yesuusana, «Kageelaatara gogire haafurakkee ooratara, Aabbokkina geelaatara, usu tos emeeyinanna, usu wotana girinanna. <verse eid="JHN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24"/>Kageelaannon haafurakkee lakkoɂoorataro, hikki kamaalattan haafura in kafarero kaɂodoya kuwaarre kakkee lakkoyo.<verse eid="JHN 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25"/>«Gidda isinne wota giraan hikka dubba segeera. <verse eid="JHN 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26"/>Odo megekkeeyi kafarara kagoggoɂisara Ayyaana K'ulluukki ade ayees dubba agaalssisinara, ani kasegeerona dubba shaadisinara. <verse eid="JHN 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27"/>Nogodda isinuun kayinnara, nogoddatteenna sisinara, ani tasisara alami tasisaro aanttitti lakkotto, wodanattisin arooc'annak'amo, aroonaɂabissano. <verse eid="JHN 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28"/>‹Ani seeyinara, abbaabayina isin tos emeeyinara› amanokkee maaltteettan, Aabbokki inkko mankkorooraro maraan in kageelaattan leeteenwa Odo tos biyaanokkeeyi geggelaattenwa. <verse eid="JHN 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29"/>Ani kasegeera gogudate goggoɂammanttaanun, hikki laanokko horee t'aye segeera. <verse eid="JHN 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30"/>Hikka alamikotti mooti s'alaye mankkoɂemetatto maraan hittakko danbbeebaan isin wota tanjiin lakkoɂayeesinaro, usuna in gutii odonnati lakkoɂabo, <verse eid="JHN 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31"/>ayesuun goɂameen ani Odo goggogeelataro, malee Aabbokki kasisero ajaja goggofelaroo, alami goggoɂaddeesiroonya. Kiyaa, hittakko seenno» ame.<verse eid="JHN 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Gaa kawoyiniinna ballaal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1"/>«Karrummii gaa kawoyinii aniya, kaɂabbaraterana Aabbokkeeya. <verse eid="JHN 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2"/>Usuna in gutii tagitto il kadubamoon ballaal dubba Aabbokki goosi lugudinara, il kasisaro ballaal dubba adi aaloo il goggoɂdubanttoon iidisi k'ac'c'isinara. <verse eid="JHN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3"/>Kasegeero haafurakko kakkeeyi isin gidda omuc'c'intteenttan. <verse eid="JHN 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4"/>Iyyee gira, aninna isinii girnnara, ballaal gaa kawoyinii gutii goleenoon kale il sisin lakkodaanddaaro, isinna iyye goginnoon il sisin lakkodaanddaattan.<verse eid="JHN 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5"/>«Ani gaa kawoyiniiyya, isinna ballaalttaan, maayyona iyyee gogire aninna usuu gogire usu il tamooggan sisara in kallayi koonna felin lakkodaanddeetan. <verse eid="JHN 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6"/>Iyyee kagginon ballaal shafame kaɂangagaro ballaal aankkikkiya, hikka aankkikki ballaal abaabami eleen tos shaafaminare, gubaminara. <verse eid="JHN 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7"/>Iyyee gogitteen haafurakkina isinii gogire, kadootattaan maamisikki kookona ebaayen sisamirowa. <verse eid="JHN 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8"/>Il tamooggan dubamanoo inkko oɂagaalssaattaan ootte laano gottusseen, hikkanii Aabbokki kabajaamara.<verse eid="JHN 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9"/>«Odo in goggogeelateroo aninna isin geelayera, geelanjjetteeyi gira. <verse eid="JHN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10"/>Ani Aabbokkeekki ajaja oorayeere geelanjjetteessayi goggogiro malee isinna ajajakkee goɂooratteen geelanjjetteeyi girnattaan. <verse eid="JHN 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11"/>Geggeloɂootti isinii goggolleerawun geggeloɂoottisin oɂammagameen goggolleerawun hikka ani isinuun segeera. <verse eid="JHN 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12"/>Ajajakki hikkaya, ani goggogeelayero malee isinna isiɂisi orroo geelayene.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Yan. 13:34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:17">15:17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:23">1 Yan. 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="2JN 1:5">2 Yan. 5</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13"/>Ogeelaataro maraan neefo roorssayi sisatanakko taroortto geelanjje maayyona lakkoɂabo. <verse eid="JHN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14"/>Ani isin kaɂajajaaro felooyi gohayisseen ani ogeelaatarottaan. <verse eid="JHN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15"/>Goortanu diyyijjoolkkee lakkoɂaminaro, diyyijjoolnna Goottaa kafelaro laakkaso, ayesuun goɂameen Aabbokkeekko kamaalero dubba mankkoɂaddeesisero maraan ogeelaataro amera. <verse eid="JHN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16"/>Aniya isin kaɂassaabayera kuwaarre isin in lakkoɂassaabttettaan, seeyiddeene il goggoyelattaanun ilttisinna goggogirttoon ani isin shuumera, haanssun Odo megekkeeyi kaɂebaattan dubba sisara. <verse eid="JHN 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17"/>Isiɂisi orroo goggogeelattawun, ajajakki hikkaya.<verse eid="JHN 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Alami Yesuusakko oɂagaalssataran diidano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18"/>«Alami isin godiide, isinkko horeene in diidano addeesa. <verse eid="JHN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19"/>Isin oɂalami lii gitteenwa, alami oottessa laano addeesire isin geelaatarewa, ani alamikko isin kale yele mankkoɂassaabero maraan oɂalami lakkottaan, alamina kakkondiidara haanssunya. <verse eid="JHN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20"/>Kahandaara goottakkeessakko lakkorooraro ame ani kasegeero haafura shaada. In horoora gogireen, isinna adi horoornnaran, haafurakkee kaɂoorateran golleen haafurakkisinna oorayinnaran.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mat. 10:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luk'. 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Yan. 13:16</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21"/>In kafarero mankkokasoon maraan, megekkeekkotti aalanttii hikka felinnaraan. <verse eid="JHN 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22"/>Emeeyi segiwayewa c'ubbo lakkollaare, gidda ade c'ubbokkisoowun ade aalantti lakkoɂabaan. <verse eid="JHN 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23"/>In kadiidara, Aabbokkeena diidara. <verse eid="JHN 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24"/>Kakkalee ibaaddo kafeloongiro isoo orroo feliwayewa, c'ubbo lakkollaare, gidda ade inna Aabbokkeenna deenan, gidda ade inna Aabbokkeenna diideraan. <verse eid="JHN 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25"/>Hikkina, ‹Aalanttikallayi diideen› amame seerakisooyi kas'aafamera haafura goggogudaroonya.<verse eid="JHN 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26"/>«Ani Odo dollekko isinuun kafarnara, Odokko kabiyaaro kagoggoɂisiro karrummii Ayyaana kakkoɂemeete goorata, usu garakkee atotinara. <verse eid="JHN 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27"/>Isinna addeen, horaarjjewa inne wota mankkogitteen, maraan atotinattaan.<verse eid="JHN 15:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1"/>«Hikka dubba kasegeera ammanokkisinkko goggoshiriɂamoonkoya. <verse eid="JHN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2"/>Ayihuudi kakkokukkuɂamarekkona, beesinaran suurewa kallagadinara dubba Waawun goggohandaye malee kakkotootamira goorata emeetara. <verse eid="JHN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3"/>Hikka dubba kakkonyelnanaa, Odo goorttun in mankkokasoon maraanya. <verse eid="JHN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4"/>Horeene hikka ani isinuun kakkonsegeera goorata gogee goggoshaaddanunya, isin wota mankkogire maraan, t'aye hikka lakkosegeero.<verse eid="JHN 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayyaana K'ulluukkikonɂi felo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5"/>«Goortta in kafarero tos seeyinara, halleewo kuwaarre isinkko, ‹Haggerraa seeyinatta?› ami in kahosayinara laagiro. <verse eid="JHN 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6"/>Hikka ayeesanoonna wodanattisin gaddaa ammaganttetta. <verse eid="JHN 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7"/>Ayesuun goɂameen ani rumminaa rumminaa amara seetanokki isinuun laɂo sisirowa, ani goseetanawaye kagoggoɂisara isin tos lakkoɂemeetaro, ani goseeye adi Ayyaana K'ulluukki isin tos farnnara. <verse eid="JHN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8"/>Kakkoɂemeete gooratana alami c'ubbo maraan, gara kak'ulluumaanna gara kafirdda addeesisi tusinara. <verse eid="JHN 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9"/>C'ubbokkisoo addeesise kakkoontusara, ibaaddo iyyee mankko ammanoon maraanya. <verse eid="JHN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10"/>Gara kak'ullummaa addeesise kakkontusara, Odo tos mankkoseeyinaronna hittakko danbbeebaan in isin mankkodeennon maraanya. <verse eid="JHN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11"/>Gara kafirdda addeesise katusara hikka alamikokki mooti talleetetta s'alaye mankkofirddaanttetto maraanya.<verse eid="JHN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12"/>«Ganaa kamooggan ani isinuun kaseginara gira, gidda adi atayin lakkodaanddeetan. <verse eid="JHN 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13"/>Karrummii Ayyaana kakkoɂemeete goorata rummi dubba tos geegeesirowa, usu iskko lakkoɂayeesaro, kamaalero kaalaal ayeesara, usumaleenna horenbbaan kallinaro seginara. <verse eid="JHN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14"/>Kakkee kalleerokko aatere goggoɂaddeesawun yelaa in kabajinara. <verse eid="JHN 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15"/>Kaɂodo kalleera dubba kakkeeyya, goortta ‹Kakke kallerokko aatire goggoɂaddeesawun seginara› kakkoon amera haanssunya.<verse eid="JHN 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16"/>«Arri uc'c'arkko abbaabayi lakkodinnattaan, halleewo kuwaarre arri uc'c'arkko abbaabayi adi dinnattaan.»<verse eid="JHN 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaada geggeloo tos iggilissamano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17"/>Yesuusakko oɂagaalssatareenkko kookkoo, « ‹Goorata kic'c'arkko abbaabayi in lakkodinnattaan, halleewo kuwaarre goorata kic'c'arkko danbbenne adi dinattan usumaleenna, odo tos mankkoseeyinaro› maraan goɂamiro meɂamanoya?» isiɂisi orroo ameen. <verse eid="JHN 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18"/>« ‹Goorata kic'c'ar amano me amanoya?› usu kaɂayeesara ayees lakkotabero» amaa isiɂisi orroo hoosataa gireen.<verse eid="JHN 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19"/>Yesuusana usu hoosayin dootano kakkoɂaddeese goorata, «Ani, goorata kic'c'arkko danbbenne in lakkodinnattaan, ‹Halleewo kuwaarre goorata kic'c'arkko danbbenena adi dinnattaan mankkoɂameroon, me amanoyyo isiɂisi orroo isiɂisi hoosattaan›? <verse eid="JHN 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20"/>Ani rumminaa rumminaa amara, isin ooyinattaan, gaddinattan, alami adi geggelaayinara, halleewo kuwaarre gaddakkisin geggeloo tos iggilisaminara. <verse eid="JHN 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21"/>Heleelttiti arri giidde umulaagiraan c'annak'aamatta, kakkoɂumultte goorata adde ibaaddo alami tos mankkoɂemeetero maraan kac'c'annak'k'aamatte illowaatta. <verse eid="JHN 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22"/>Isinuunna hikkamalee gidda kagadda goorataya, golleenna adi ani isin mankkodinnaro maraan in geggelaayisara, geggeloɂoottisinna isinkko kaɂaatira laagiro. <verse eid="JHN 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23"/>Eserritti inkko koonna lakkoɂebaayinattaan, ani rumminaa rumminaa amara Odo megekkeeyi kaɂebaattan dubba sisinara. <verse eid="JHN 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24"/>Gidda gin megekkeeyi koonna lakkoɂebaatteettan, ebaayen atattaanwa, geggeloɂoottisinna oɂammagameen goggolleerawun ebaayen.<verse eid="JHN 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25"/>«Gidda gin kasegeera masuussayi golleenna hitakko horenbbaan gara kaɂodoo masuussayi halleennoon giraan diidaabbeesi kakkoɂayeesira goorata emeetara. <verse eid="JHN 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26"/>Eserri megekkeeyi ebaayinattan, aninna Odo isin maraan lakkoɂebaayinaro. <verse eid="JHN 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27"/>Aalanttina odo metekkeessawa isin mankkogeelatero maraana Waa dollekko emeetanokkee mankkoɂammantteettaan maraanya. <verse eid="JHN 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28"/>Odokko beere alami tos emeeyera, gidda ade alami iisere Odo tos seeyinara» ame.<verse eid="JHN 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29"/>Esekkona Yesuusakko oɂagaalssataran haa ameen, «Goortta gidda ati masuussa kallaayi addeesise ayeesaa gitta. <verse eid="JHN 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30"/>Gidda ayees dubba goggoɂaddeesattona maayyona ku hoosayin dootisi waatti addeeseeran, hikkina Waa dollekko emeetano goggoɂammannoon yelera» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31"/>Yesuusana, «Gidda ammantteettaan amanoya?» <verse eid="JHN 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32"/>«Hikkima isin dubbana rarraanne kakkodarɂaaminnattaan goorata emeetera, usu gooratana giddaaya, inna kale isaaginattaan, halleewo kuwaarre Aabbokki inneta mankkogiro maraan ani lakkokale giro.<verse eid="JHN 16:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33"/>«Iyyee giriddeene nogoddaa goggogirttaanun, hikka segeera, alami girantuun rakkoo abttaan, ayesuun goɂameen allamandde, ani alami awodera» ame abbaabe.<verse eid="JHN 16:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa isiɂoottessaan ebaatano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1"/>Yesuusa hikka haafura ayeese abbaabatere, daruur tos t'ok'k'imere haa ame ebaate,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="JHN 17:1">«Aabbokki, goorata geera, Erekka ku goggokabajiroo Erekkaa kabajiina. <verse eid="JHN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2"/>Kakkonkabajaattana ati kasissetto dubbaan erkka jiruu jiroommakki giri goggosisiroon ibaaddo dubbaa gutii odonnati mankkosissetto maraanya. <verse eid="JHN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3"/>Jiruu jiroommakki girina ati kaalaa karrummii Waa Hedona kafarttetto Yesuusa Kiristoosa addeesanoya. <verse eid="JHN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4"/>Ati iin osissette felo gudisegure ku ulii gutii kabajee. <verse eid="JHN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5"/>Goortta Aabbokkee! Alami hamet't'aamoon kunne wota tagitte kabajaa ku dollee in kabajii.»<verse eid="JHN 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa usukko oɂagaalssatareewun ebaate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6"/>«Hinɂa ati alamikko assaabttedde iin osissetto ibaaddojjaan megekkaa addeesisera. Oottayeen, iyyeen sise, isona haafurakkaa oorateen. <verse eid="JHN 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7"/>Ati kasissetta dubba kukko laano iso giddaa addeeseeran. <verse eid="JHN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8"/>Aalanttina ati iin kasissetto haafurakkaa ani isoon sise gollee atateeran, aninna ku dollekko bi emeetano ogiraan iso addeeseeran, ati in faranona iso ammaneraan. <verse eid="JHN 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9"/>Iso oottaa mankkolleeran maraan isoon ebaayinara, ati iin osissettoonna oottaa olleeraawun kuwaarre alamiin lakkoɂebaayinaro. <verse eid="JHN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10"/>Kakkee kalleera dubba kakkaayya, kakka kalleerana dubba kakkeeyya, isoonna kabajaamera. <verse eid="JHN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11"/>Goortta ani alami orroo lakkoɂadallaayinaro, iso adeen alami orro ginaan, ani ku tos emeetanoya, k'ulluukki Aabbokki, noo koo goggolleenennoo, isona koo goggolleenawun kasissetto megee oori. <verse eid="JHN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12"/>Ani isone wota takkogiree, ati kasissetto megekkaayi iso golisera, aninna oorera, kamas'aafa haafura goggogudaroo koo kabbayi ere kuwaarre isokko maayyona lakkobayero.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ati iin kasissetto megee ani iso oorera: kookkoo kahorkkoo mas'aafal «Ati iin kasissetto dubba megekkaayi oorera» amara, </char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Mez. 41:9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:18">Yan. 13:18</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13"/>Gidda iin ku tos emeetanoya, ayesuun goɂameen geggeloɂootti isoo dollee oɂammagameen goggolleerawun, gidda alami giraan hikka ani ayeesara. <verse eid="JHN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14"/>Ani haafurakkaa isoon sisera, ani alamikko lakkoyo, isona alamikko lakkoyaan; haanssun alami iso diidera. <verse eid="JHN 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15"/>Kakkoon ebaatarana kameellankko goggoɂoorttoon kuwaarre, alamikko goggobeesson lakkoyo. <verse eid="JHN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16"/>Ani alamikko goggolleennon giro malee, isona alamikko lakkoyyan. <verse eid="JHN 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17"/>Haafurakka rummiya, rummittaayi k'ullooyisina. <verse eid="JHN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18"/>Ati alami tos in goggofarttettoo aninna alami tos iso farera. <verse eid="JHN 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19"/>Iso rumminaa goggok'ullooyinawun, isiɂootte iso maraan k'ullooyisayera.»<verse eid="JHN 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa usu kaɂammanaro dubbaan ebaate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20"/>«Agaalssiskkisoo atateeren iyyee oɂammanaraawun adereya kuwaarre hinɂa oolaalun ani lakkoɂebaayinaro. <verse eid="JHN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21"/>Hikkina, Aabbo! Ati iyyee goggogittoo, aninna kuyyee goggogiroo, dubbana koo goggolleenawun, usumaleenna ati in farano alami goggoɂammanoon, isona noyyee goggogirrawunya. <verse eid="JHN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22"/>Noo koo goggolleenennoo isona koo goggolleenawun, tasissetto kabaja sisera. <verse eid="JHN 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23"/>Hikkina ani isoo, atina iyyee laanoya, ati in goggofartettona in goggogeelatetto gitakki isona goggogeelatetto alami goggoɂaddeesiroon, koonnatikkiso kaɂaddeesame halleewo.»<verse eid="JHN 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24"/>«Aabbokkee! Hinɂi ati iin osissetta, ani mankkogiroo goggogirraawun alami hamet't'aamooni in mankkogeelaattetto maraan ati iin tasissetto kabajattee iso goggoddeerawun dootara.»<verse eid="JHN 17:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25"/>«K'ulluukki Aabbokkee! Alami gokkasanawatena, ani kasowa, hinɂina ati in farano kasaanwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26"/>Iyyeen tagitta geelanjjetta isoon goggogirttoo, aninna isoo goggogirroo, megekka goggoɂaddeesinawun yelera, goggoɂaddeesinawuna yelinara.»<verse eid="JHN 17:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa usu odiidareeni abame</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat. 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar. 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk'. 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1"/>Yesuusa hikka ebi gudise abbaabatere usukko oɂagaalssatareene wota kak'edirooni laga nak'eene, t'ayeen takkogireen taɂakaakiltte banɂe tos tabeen. <verse eid="JHN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2"/>Goorata kamooggan Yesuusa usukko oɂagaalssatareenne wota esee mankkoɂeselaro maraan, roorse kasisera Yihuudana banɂe kasanaayewa. <verse eid="JHN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3"/>Yihuudana wotaadaral usumaleenna katuuk'aamol woyichchaalkkona Farasaawilkko ofarameeraan k'ulluukki min kawaa oɂooraneenne wota k'ajeelisaa banɂe taɂakaakiltte tos emeete, isona dab, faanosina huu kajjereene abateen gireen. <verse eid="JHN 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4"/>Yesuusana usu kaginnaro dubba addeesere iso tos beere, «Isin kadootattaan ayyoyya?» ame. <verse eid="JHN 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5"/>Isona, «Kanaazireti Yesuusaya» ameen. Yesuusana, «Usu aniya» ame. Roorse kasiserana Yihuuda iso wota aallee gire. <verse eid="JHN 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6"/>Yesuusana, «Usu aniya» kakkoɂamare goorata haararttii gaggabeenguren ul iyyeen.<verse eid="JHN 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7"/>Adena «Isin kadootattaan ayyoyya?» Ame hoosate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Isona «Kanaazireti Yesuusaya ameen.»<verse eid="JHN 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8"/>Yesuusana abbaabere, «Usu aniya» amera hayya, «In kadootattaan gollee hinɂi haseeten isaaga ame.» <verse eid="JHN 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9"/>Hikki kakkoleera, «Ati iin osissetto hinɂakko koonna lakkobayero» ame kaɂayeesera haafura goggogudaroonya.<verse eid="JHN 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10"/>Shiifa abate kagire Simoona P'et'iroosa shiifa miɂate tuuk'aamokokki woyichchaan kahandaare basere nebe tamergge goose «Kahandaarekokki megena Malkkoosa amamare».<verse eid="JHN 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11"/>Yesuusana P'et'iroosane, «Shiifa kofoo tabisina! Odo iin tasisero tarrakkoo t'ugga kat'amoon aani laara?» ame.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:39">Mat. 26:39</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:36">Mar. 14:36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:42">Luk'. 22:42</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa tuuk'aamon odonnati kaɂabo Haanna horee aallee</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57">Mat. 26:57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12"/>Wotaadarana kaɂajajaaro kakkisone wota Ayihuudin ohandaareenna raattoo leene Yesuusa abeen, shiyeen, <verse eid="JHN 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13"/>Horaarjje, kak'eyaafa soddo kalleero Haanna tos geesen, K'eyaafa usu geesii tuuk'aamon odonnati kaɂaboye. <verse eid="JHN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14"/>K'eyaafa, gosa marantuun odo koo goggoye kaɂidankkiya amaa Ayihuudin markkasisaa kagire ibaaddotiye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:49-50">Yan. 11:49-50</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kakatano kap'et'iroosa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Mat. 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mar. 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luk'. 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15"/>Simoona kaɂamamare P'et'iroosana kakkalee koo Yesuusakko kaɂagaalssatare Yesuusa debee seeteen, tuuk'aamon odonnati kaɂaboon mankkoɂaddeesamare maraan, Yesuusa wota tuuk'aamon odonnati kaɂabokokki awud tos tabe. <verse eid="JHN 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16"/>P'et'iroosa ade karrakkoo sarre hese. Tuuk'aamokokki woyichchaneta kaɂaddeesamare kakkalee Yesuusakko kaɂagaalssatare abbaabatere karra taɂooratte ayeesisere P'et'iroosa aate tabe. <verse eid="JHN 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17"/>Karra taɂoorattena P'et'iroosane, «Ati hikka ibaaddotikko kaɂagaalssatarokko koo lakkottoya?» Antte.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Usuna «Lakkoɂaniyyo» ame.<verse eid="JHN 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18"/>Gooratana kaɂanbboloolisare mankkollee maraan ohandaareenna eleen beebesateen maraamureen maar kolkkolisayin aalleen gineen, P'et'iroosana iso wota aalleere eleen t'ant'amaa gire.<verse eid="JHN 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa tuuk'aamokokki woyichcha horee aallee</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-68">Mat. 26:59-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-65">Mar. 14:55-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">Luk'. 22:63-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19"/>Usu goorata tuuk'aamokokki woyichcha Yesuusa usukko oɂagaalssatareenkokki garana agaalssisanokkeesakokki gara hoosaten.<verse eid="JHN 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20"/>Yesuusana, «Ani alamiin addeesise ayeesera Ayihuudi takkokukkuɂamarena, k'ulluukki min kaɂebii arri dubba agaalssisera, siyame kaɂayeesera laagiro. <verse eid="JHN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21"/>Mewuun in hoosata? Ani isoon kasegeero omaaleeran hoosa, hikkima, hinɂi ani kaɂayeesero kasaanwa.»<verse eid="JHN 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22"/>Yesuusa hikka kakkoɂayeesare goorata dollee aalleen ogireen k'ulluukki min kawaa oɂoorareenkko koo, «Tuuk'aamokokki woyichchaan haa abbaabata?» amere balabaanjjoo usu base.<verse eid="JHN 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23"/>Yesuusana, «Tameellan kaɂayeese gollee» «Tameellan ayeesanokkee atotiin, rummi goɂayeese adde mewuun basatta?» ame.<verse eid="JHN 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24"/>Esekko Haanna Yesuusa shaame goggogiree tuuk'aamokokki woyichcha K'eyaafa tos fare.<verse eid="JHN 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kap'et'iroosa kallamina kaseedi kakatano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mat. 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mar. 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luk'. 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25"/>Simoona kaɂamamere P'et'iroosa aalleere eleen t'ant'amaa giraan; kakkalee ibaaddona «Usukko oɂagaalssatarankko koo la atittolla?» ame.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Usuna, «Lakkoɂaniyyo» ame kakate.<verse eid="JHN 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26"/>Tuuk'aamokokki woyichchaan ohandaareenkko koo P'et'iroosa nebe kagoosero ibaaddotin falli kalleere, «Taɂakaakiltte banɂee ani ku Yesuusane wota lakkodeeya?» ame hoosate. <verse eid="JHN 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27"/>P'et'iroosana ade kakate, goorsewa lukkale oye.<verse eid="JHN 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa P'ilaat'oosa horee</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat. 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mar. 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk'. 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28"/>Ayihuudi Yesuusa min kak'eyaafakko karoomi mooti P'ilaat'oosakotti k'aye aateen seeteen, gooratana bariye, Ayihuudina kafaasikkaa baala mankkoɂaaminnare maraan battowanakko ameeren awud kamootiti tos lakkotabeeran. <verse eid="JHN 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29"/>Haanssun P'ilaat'oosa iso tos beere, «Hikka ibaaddoti gutii kamootattaan mooto meya?» ame iso hoosate.<verse eid="JHN 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30"/>Isona abbaabeen, «Hikki ibaaddoti felo omeellan feliwaatewa noo kuun roorisi lakkosisinanne» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31"/>P'ilaat'oosana, «Isin issiiwa geesaddeen seerakkisin malee firddaa» ame.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Ayihuudina, «Noo maayyona goggolaganddon feɂi lakkoɂabnno» ameen. <verse eid="JHN 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32"/>Hikkina kakkonleera Yesuusa misikki goyi goyinaro tusin amere kaɂayeesera haafura goggogudaroonya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:14">Yan. 3:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:32">12:32</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33"/>P'ilaat'oosana awud tos abbaabatere Yesuusa uumsisere, «Ati kaɂayihuudi wonotta?» ame hoosate.<verse eid="JHN 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34"/>Yesuusana, «Hikki yaada kakkaayya?» «Goorttun kakkalee garakkee kasegenanya?» ame abbaabe.<verse eid="JHN 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35"/>P'ilaat'oosana abbaabere, «Ani Ayihuudiya?» «Ku in tos kafarera gosakkaanna katuuk'aamol woyichchaalya; ayesuun ati me yelttedeya?» ame abbaabe.<verse eid="JHN 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36"/>Yesuusana, «Wononnatikki hikka alamikko lakkoyo, lii girewa Ayihuudi goggoɂaboonkko ohandaareen jereen shafataneewa, gidda ade wononnatikki hikka alamikko lakkoyo» ame.<verse eid="JHN 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37"/>P'ilaat'oosana, «Hayya ati wonotta amanoyolla!» ame.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Yesuusana, «Ani wono laano gara anttetta, ani kakkoonɂumulamerana hikka alami tonssa kakkoon emeeyera gara karrummii atotiinya, rummikko kallee dubba haafurakkee maalara» ame.<verse eid="JHN 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38"/>P'ilaat'oosana, «Rummi metta?» ame. Hikka ayeese abbaabatere adena Ayihuudi tos beere haa ame; «Ani hikka ibaaddoti gutii kamootisiro baas koonna lakkohelero, <verse eid="JHN 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39"/>Ayesuun goɂameen faasikkaayi kashaamerokko odo koo furanokokki woga abttaan, ‹Haanssun kaɂayihuudi wono goggofurroon dootaattan›?» ame.<verse eid="JHN 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40"/>Isona adeen iyyaa, «Laa lakkoɂusuyo! Barbaane furi!» ameen. Barbaane ade shittaayye.<verse eid="JHN 18:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa goggosuwaamiron murttesame</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mat. 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mar. 15:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1"/>P'ilaat'oosa Yesuusa haggaɂaatere boc'c'iise. <verse eid="JHN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2"/>Wotaadaralnna eɂeen mammaren kallachcha aani mete kayesuusaa gutii kayeen, heela buraaburrekki sarssi sarssiseen. <verse eid="JHN 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3"/>Maraamureen «Kaɂayihuudi wono geggelaana» amaa balabaanjjoo basa gineen.<verse eid="JHN 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4"/>P'ilaat'oosana ade awud tos beere, koonna mooton ogeegisiraan felo omeellan heliwaatti goggoɂaddeessanun, «Goortta ani usu isin tos beesinara» ame. <verse eid="JHN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5"/>Yesuusa kallachcha kaɂeɂeenee kaatere heela buraaburrekki sarssi sarssate bee, P'ilaat'oosana, «Hikkima, ibaaddoti!» ame.<verse eid="JHN 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6"/>Katuuk'aamol woyichchaalnna k'ulluukki min kawaa oɂooraneen Yesuusa kakkodiyaareen goorata, «Suuyina! Suuyina!» amaa okkeen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">P'ilaat'oosana ade, «Isin geesayendden suwaayen, in tonsse mooton ogeegisiran felo omeellan ani lakkohelero» ame.<verse eid="JHN 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7"/>Ayihuudina, «Noo seera abinna, isiɂootteessa Ere kawaa mankkoyele maraan seerakaani malee goyin dootisara» ameen. <verse eid="JHN 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8"/>P'ilaat'oosa hikka kakkomaalare goorata aaloo abssate, <verse eid="JHN 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9"/>Awud tos abbaabatere Yesuusa, «Ati hayekko emeettetta?» Ame hoosate,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:9">Yesuusa ade koonna lakkoɂabbaabero. <verse eid="JHN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10"/>P'ilaat'oosana, «Lakkosegaattoya? Ani ku furin goorttun suyin odonnati abano laakkassoya?» ame.<verse eid="JHN 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11"/>Yesuusana, «Waakko sisamiwatewa in gutii odonnati lakkogirare, haanssun kuyeen roorse kasisera ibaaddoti c'ubbokko karoore c'ubbo aba» ame.<verse eid="JHN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12"/>Esekko abbaabatere P'ilaat'oosa Yesuusa furin doote, Ayihuudi ade, «Hikka ibaaddoti gofurtte K'eesari kageelaatto lakkotto, isiɂoottessa wono kayelatara K'eesari kadiidaroya» amaa okkaano horeddeen.<verse eid="JHN 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13"/>P'ilaat'oosa hikka maalere Yesuusa saarddese beese, eɂemokokki yaamano taɂamamatte banɂee kafirdda barc'umaa hamas's'ee, hitti banɂena taɂaramayikki heɂii Gebetaa amantte uumamatte. <verse eid="JHN 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14"/>Arri kafaasikkaa baala takkoɂekkaasanatte gooratana arrikko saatii lekki lee gire. P'ilaat'oosana Ayihuudine, «Hikkima wonokkisin» ame. <verse eid="JHN 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15"/>Iso adeen, «Baasina! Baasina! Suuyina!» amaa iyyeen. P'ilaat'oosana, «Wonokkisin suyuu?» ame.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Katuk'aamo woyichchaalnna, «Karoomi wono K'eesari kuwaarre kakkalee wono noo lakkoɂabnno» ameen abbaabeen.<verse eid="JHN 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16"/>Gudisanonna P'ilaat'oosa Yesuusa goggosuyiraawun roorise sise. Wotaadaralna Yesuusa abeen geesen.<verse eid="JHN 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusakokki suwaamano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:33-44">Mat. 27:33-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:22-32">Mar. 15:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:33-43">Luk'. 23:33-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17"/>Usuna mask'aliitteessa sidatere taɂaramayikki heɂii «Golggottaa» amantte taɂuumamatto «Buk'k'e taɂmete» taɂamamatte banɂe bee. <verse eid="JHN 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18"/>Eseenna suyeen, usu wotana ibaaddo lama, koo mina tabetene, koonna mina tamerggeenne, Yesuusa t'eɂe yeleene suyeen. <verse eid="JHN 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19"/>P'ilaat'oosana s'uufi s'aafere masik'alii gutii reerese; s'uufina, kanaazireti Yesuusa, kaɂayihuudi wono taɂamattotte. <verse eid="JHN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20"/>Yesuusa takkosuuwamere banɂe katamaa dollee mankkogitte maraan omooggan Ayihuudi s'uufi nabbabeen, s'uufinna, heɂi taɂibrayist'ii talaatininna, tagiriikkitte. <verse eid="JHN 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21"/>Kaɂayihuudi tuuk'aamolkokki woyichchaalnna P'ilaat'oosa diidaa, «Usu, ‹kaɂayihuudi wonoya› amera ami s'aafi kuwaarre kaɂayihuudi wono ami aroos'aafitte» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22"/>P'ilaat'oosana, «Ani kas'aafero s'aafera» ame abbaabe.<verse eid="JHN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23"/>Wotaadaral Yesuusa suyeen abbaabateen, k'olokkeessa hesaa, huukkeessa aateeren metemetewun koo koo goggogeegeeron benɂe afar hedeedameen, elekko taa hegel geetoon amalekkoo leete haɂiriiramooni tafelanttetta. <verse eid="JHN 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24"/>Haanssun, «It'aa beesayinne kakkoonbeete hageete» kuwaarre «Lakkofiilnno» ameen. Hikkina kakkoonlleera</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">«Huukkee hedeedameen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">k'olona it'aa beesaten»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">kaɂamamera kamas'aafa haafura goggogudaroonya. Wotaadaralna kafeeleran hikkawaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Mez. 22:18</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25"/>Tayesuusa masik'alii dollee Aayetteessana Aayetteessakotti abba, tak'elyoop'a oori Mayiraamena ul kamegidellakotti Mayiraame esee aalleen gireen. <verse eid="JHN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26"/>Eseenna Yesuusa Aayetteessana kageelaatare usukko kaɂagaalssatare dollee aalleen giraan kakkodiyaare goorata Aayetteessane, «Ati heleelttiti, erekka hikkima» ame.<verse eid="JHN 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27"/>Usukko kaɂagaalssatarene, «Aayetta hittima» ame. Usu gooratakko haggaɂabere hikki usukko kaɂagaalssatare minkkeessa tos atate.<verse eid="JHN 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Goyi kayesuusa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:48-50">Mat. 27:48-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:36-37">Mar. 15:36-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:36">Luk'. 23:36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28"/>Esekko Yesuusa ayees dubba gudatano addeesere, kamas'aafa haafura goggogudaroo, «Ani sugubaayewa!» ame.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Mez. 69:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:15">22:15</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29"/>Eseenna taɂokokaatta woyinii hubuchcho mig leete gitte, isona isifooniji t'amo kawoyinniitii t'uuk'iseene, ogorro kaɂabo baalii hiɂi tos gabbaleen. <verse eid="JHN 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30"/>Yesuusana kaɂokokootaro kakkok'k'ammassare goorata «Gudatewa» ame.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:30">Metekkeessa hussisatere, neefotteessa roorse sise.<verse eid="JHN 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aaranjja tayesuusa jereeni eegamano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31"/>Esekko abbaabatere arri Ayihuudin tafoolissi arriwuun takkoɂekkaasatarantte. Ayihuudi, kasuwamero ibaaddokokki rees tafoolssii arri masik'alii gutii goggohayinonkko mankkodootateen maraaninna kaletti tafoolssii arri mankkolleete maraan, osuwaameeran ibaaddojja gilb ebisereen rees goggodagiroon P'ilaat'oosa ebaaten. <verse eid="JHN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32"/>Haanssun wotaadaral emetere Kiristoosane wota suwaame kagire kahoraarjjee ibaaddotikokki gilb ebiseen, adeen kakkaleekokki gilb usumalee ebiseen. <verse eid="JHN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33"/>Yesuusa tos kakkoɂemeeteren goorata kagoyero mankkodeeren maraan gilb lakkoɂebseeren. <verse eid="JHN 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34"/>Ayesuun goɂameen wotaadaralkko koo aaranjja tayesuusa jereeni eegge, goorsewa iigina bekena ubate. <verse eid="JHN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35"/>Hikka kaddeera ibaaddoti atonnati sisera, atonnatina rummiya, rummi ayeesanona kasowa, isinna goggoɂammanttaanun atotaara. <verse eid="JHN 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36"/>Hikkina kalleera, mas'aafa, «Lefaalkko koonna lakkoɂebiro» Kaɂamamera goggogudaroonya,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 9:12">To. 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:20">Mez. 34:20</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zak. 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Rag. 1:7</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37"/>kakkalee k'ulluukki mas'aafana, «Hassu kaɂeeggeran iso dinnaraan» amara.<verse eid="JHN 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">K'amalamano kayesuusa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat. 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar. 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk'. 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38"/>Hittakko abbaabatere kaɂarmmatiyasi Yoosefa kayesuusa rees atayin P'ilaat'oosa ebaate, Yoosefana Ayihuudi mankkoɂabssatero maraan hetoo Yesuusakko kaɂagaalssataroye. Usuna P'ilaat'oosa feɂi kakkosisare goorata emeete rees atate. <verse eid="JHN 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39"/>Esekko horeene hemeen Yesuusa tos emeete kagire Nik'odimoosa koffichcha sonddom talleeto aaloo awɂallo pulipulisona kaɂokokootaro baac'u aate emeete.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:1-2">Yan. 3:1-2</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40"/>Isona rees kaɂyesuusa aateeren kaɂayihuudi rees ekkaasanokokki seeraa shittoonne wota k'amaluun gashee mammareen. <verse eid="JHN 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41"/>Yesuusa takkosuwaamera banɂena taɂakaakiltte benɂette, taɂakaakiltte benɂe maayyona takkok'amalamoon giro kaɂusub k'amaliye. <verse eid="JHN 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42"/>Ayihuudin tafoolssi arriwuun takkoɂekkaasataraan arri mankkoleetewun tak'amal banɂe ene mankkoleewun Yesuusa esee k'amaleen.<verse eid="JHN 19:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa goyikko kee</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat. 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mar. 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-10">Luk'. 24:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1"/>Tawoggaa arri, bariinoo ganaa ul dimimmisane giraan, tamegidella Mayiraame k'amal tos seete, eɂemona k'amalkko kaɂotottoolero deete. <verse eid="JHN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2"/>Haanssun Simoona P'et'iroosa tos Yesuusa geelataa kagire kakkalee usukko kaɂagaalssatare tos tiyaa emeetedde, «Gootta k'amalkko beesen aateena, eetii kayeeraan laakansso» antte.<verse eid="JHN 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3"/>Esekkona P'et'iroosana kakkalee Yesuusakko kaɂagaalssatarena beenee k'amal tos seeteen. <verse eid="JHN 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4"/>Lamaa tiyaa giraan, kakkalee Yesuusakko kaɂagaalssatarana P'et'iroosakko t'aye tak'amal banɂe gee. <verse eid="JHN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5"/>Hussimere takkok'amalamero banɂe godeero gashe taalaal girano dee, k'amal tos ade lakkotabere. <verse eid="JHN 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6"/>Debeesseseeta kagire Simoona kaɂamamere P'et'iroosa geere k'amal tos tabe, usuna tannek'amalereen gashe taalaal dee. <verse eid="JHN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7"/>Usumaleenna mete kayesuusa gutii tamamarantte gitte hoc'c'o dee, hitti hoc'c'ona tak'amal gashekko kale beete mamarantte gitte. <verse eid="JHN 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8"/>Esekkona t'aye k'amal tos kageera kakkalee Yesuusakko kaɂagaalssatare k'amal orroddee tabe, deerena ammane. <verse eid="JHN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9"/>Hikkina Yesuusa goyikko kiyaano girano ganaa mas'aafakko lakkoɂaddeeseren.<verse eid="JHN 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa kamegidella ulkotti Mayirameen mute</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat. 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mar. 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10"/>Esekko abbaabatereen Yesuusakko oɂagaalssatareen lamana min minkkisoo galeen. <verse eid="JHN 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11"/>Ul tamegiddellakotti Mayiraame adde k'amalkko sarre aalliitedde ootaa gitte, ootaanna k'amal din hussi antte. <verse eid="JHN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12"/>Rees kayesuusa mankkogire banɂe, huu gumaara gumaarakki osarssateeraan erggichcha lama koo metene koo luk'k'ane ohamas's'eeran deete. <verse eid="JHN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13"/>Isona Mayiraamine, «Ati heleelttiti, mewuun owaatta?» ameen hoosaten.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Esena, «Goottakkee aateena, eetii kayeeraan laakkaso» antte.<verse eid="JHN 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14"/>Hikka anttedde haararttii gowochiito Yesuusa esee kaɂaalleero deete, Yesuusa laano ese adde lakkoɂaddeesetto. <verse eid="JHN 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15"/>Yesuusana, «Ati heleelttiti, mewuun owaatta? Ayyona dootatta?» ame.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Esena taɂakaakiltte banɂe kaɂooraro aani leere, «Goottakki, ati goɂaattetto, maganne maaggee kayitetto segii ani ataro» antte.<verse eid="JHN 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16"/>Yesuusana, «Mayiraame!» ame. Esena, usu tos abbaabattedde taɂibrayist'i heɂii, «Rebuuni!» antte, fureenna «Kaɂagaalssisatto!» amanoya.<verse eid="JHN 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17"/>Yesuusana, «Ganaa Odo tos mankkobeennon giro maraan, aroodintte, halleewo kuwaarre abbilaalttee tos seedde, ‹Aabbokkee tosna Aabbokkisin tos, Hedokkee tonssa Hedokkisin tos binnara amera› amidde segii» ame.<verse eid="JHN 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18"/>Kamegidella ulkotti Mayiraamena Yesuusakko oɂagaalssatareen tos seettedde, «Gootta deelle!» Antte usu kaɂamerona segite.<verse eid="JHN 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa usukko oɂagaalssatareewun mute</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat. 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar. 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk'. 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19"/>Usu almmaawa, tahoraarjjee arri tawoggaa hemeen, Yesuusakko oɂagaalssatareen Ayihuudi abisateneen ufa c'ufateen kukkuɂameen giraan, Yesuusa emetere iso t'eɂee aalleere, «Nogodda isinuun halleeto!» ame. <verse eid="JHN 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20"/>Hikkana amere genennona aaranjjana tusate, Yesuusakko oɂagaalssatareenna Goottaa kakkodiyaaren goorata aaloo geggelaaten. <verse eid="JHN 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21"/>Yesuusa adena, «Nogodda isinuun halleeto, Odo in goggofareroo, aninna isin farnara» ame. <verse eid="JHN 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22"/>Hikka ame abbaabatere, ufuu amere, «Ayyaana K'ulluukki atayeen. <verse eid="JHN 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23"/>Isin c'ubbo kaɂibaaddoo haheso goɂantteen, c'ubbokkisin haheso amamirowa, isin c'ubbokkisoo haheso goɂamoon, ade c'ubbokkiso isoon haheso lakkoɂamamiro» ame.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:19">Mat. 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:18">18:18</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Toomaasan mute</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24"/>Hassu goorata tomonkko lamakko koo kalleera, Didimoosa kaɂamamare Toomaasa Yesuusa kakkoɂemeetare goorata usukko oɂagaalssatareene wota lakkogire. <verse eid="JHN 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25"/>Okkalee Yesuusakko oɂagaalssatareen Toomaasane, «Noo Goottaa deennelle!» ameen. Usu ade, «Misimaare oɂeeggameeran genennoɂoottessakki malaata goddeenoon, misimaareeli takkoɂeeggamero banɂee fer tabisi goddeenoon, aaranjjatteessaanna genettee gotabisoon lakkoɂammaninaro» ame.<verse eid="JHN 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26"/>Arri siddeedkko abbaabatere, Yesuusakko oɂagaalssatareen min orroo gineen, Toomaasana iso wota gire, ufaalnna c'ufame gire, Yesuusa ade emetere isoɂorroo aalleere, «Nogodda isinuun halleeto!» ame. <verse eid="JHN 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27"/>Esekkona Toomaasane, «Ferttaa hittarraa keeni, genennoɂootteenna deena, gene diriirssadde aaranjjatteyi tabisi, aroohedatte ammana» ame.<verse eid="JHN 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28"/>Toomaasana, «Goottaa! Hedokkee!» ame abbaabe.<verse eid="JHN 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29"/>Yesuusana, «Ati in mankkodeete maraan ammanttetta in haddeennoon oɂammanataraan adeen osommaasameenyan» ame.<verse eid="JHN 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hikka mas'aafakokki halchcha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30"/>Yesuusa hikka mas'aafaa kas'aafamoon kakkalee kamooggan malaata usukko oɂagaalssataran horee felera, <verse eid="JHN 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31"/>Ayesuun goɂameen Yesuusa usu Kiristoosa Ere kawaa laano goggoɂammanttaanunna, ammaniddeen megekkeessaa giri goggohelattaanun hikki s'aafamera.<verse eid="JHN 20:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusakko oɂagaalssatareen baasaa kunɂub abatano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1"/>Esekkona danbbene Yesuusa tat'ibraadosi labuu adena usukko oɂagaalssatareewun mute, hikkamaleena ade mute. <verse eid="JHN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2"/>Simoona kaɂamamare P'et'iroosa, Didimoosa kaɂamamare Toomaasa, kak'aana Zegaliila Naatinaɂeeli, yiis kazabddoosana Yesuusakko oɂagaalssatareen okkalee lama raattoo gineen. <verse eid="JHN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3"/>Simoona kaɂamamare P'et'iroosana, «Kunɂub abayin daganoya» ame.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:5">Luk'. 5:5</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Isona, «Noo kunne wota daginanna» ameen. Emeetene wolabo oriddeen tabeen, ese hemeen adeen koonna lakkoɂabateen. <verse eid="JHN 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4"/>Bariinoo, Yesuusa labu girii aallee gire, usukko oɂagaalssatareen adeen Yesuusa laano lakkoɂaddeesen. <verse eid="JHN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5"/>Yesuusana, «Yiiso, kunɂub abitaane?» ame.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Isona, koonna «Lakkoɂabino» ameen.<verse eid="JHN 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6"/>Usuna, «Maarrabittisin wolabokko mina tamerggenne lugudayeen, kunɂub helattaanwa» ame. Isona kakkolugudatareen goorata kunɂub mooggankko kakkeeyi maarrabi nattin waateen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:6">Luk'. 5:6</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7"/>Hassu goorata Yesuusa kageelaatare usukko kaɂagaalssatare, P'et'iroosane, «Goottayo!» ame. Simoona P'et'iroosana, «Goottayolla!» kaɂamaro haafura kakkomaalare goorata, beesate kagire sarssi tabsatere firime bekerro tabe. <verse eid="JHN 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8"/>Okkalee Yesuusakko oɂagaalssatareen adeen bagakko badi tos fakkikameeran hisil lama boolee kalleero kuwaarre aaloo lakkofakkimeenan, kunɂub takkoɂammagamere maarrabi nattaa baga emeeten. <verse eid="JHN 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9"/>Bagana kakkogiyaanee goorata, boolaal kaɂeleenee gutii kagiro kunɂubnna babo deen. <verse eid="JHN 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10"/>Yesuusana, «Gidda kaɂabtteettan kunɂubkko alla keena» ame.<verse eid="JHN 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11"/>Haanssun Simoona kaɂamamere P'et'iroosa wolaboo tabere maarrabi baga tos nattee, 153 kajinjjiin kunɂub ammagame gire, hikka gitakki kunɂub goɂabttena maarrabi lakkofiilanttetto. <verse eid="JHN 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12"/>Yesuusana «Koyeen aama» ame. Isona usu Goottaa laano addeesen mankkogireen maraan usukko oɂagaalssatareenkko koonna «Ati ayyotta?» ami hoosayin kajabaate laagire. <verse eid="JHN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13"/>Yesuusana emetere babona kunɂubna aate sise.<verse eid="JHN 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14"/>Yesuusa goyikko gokkeekko abbaabatere usukko oɂagaalsaataraawun mutano hikki kaseediye.<verse eid="JHN 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusana P'et'iroosana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15"/>Wodana oɂwaaten kakkoɂabbaabatareen goorata, Yesuusa Simoona kaɂamamere P'et'iroosane, «Ere kayoona Simoona!, hinɂakko roorise in geelatta?» ame. Usuna «Ii Goottakki!, geelatanokkee atittakkassa» ame. Yesuusana «C'ibaarkkee foofi» ame. <verse eid="JHN 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16"/>Yesuusana kallami, «Ere kayoona, Simoona, rumminaa in geelatta?» ame. Usuna, «Ii, Goottakki, ani ku geelatano atitta kassa» ame. Yesuusana, «C'odeelkkee oori» ame. <verse eid="JHN 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17"/>Gooratta kaseedina, «Ere kayoona, Simoona; in geelatta?» ame. P'et'iroosana goorata kaseedi Yesuusa, «In geelatta?» ame mankkohoosatewun gaddaa tabere «Goottaa ati dubba kassowa goggogeelatarona kassowa» ame. Yesuusana, «Idaadkkee foofi ame. <verse eid="JHN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18"/>Ani rumminaa rumminaa amara, ati wodallumaa giraan sarssikkaa issii tabissattedde mankkogeelaatte seetaa gitte, gojaaroɂntte adi gene diriirssayinatta, ibaaddo kakkaleenna huukkaa tabisire seeyin mankkogeelaannoon geesinara.» <verse eid="JHN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19"/>Yesuusa hikka kakkoon amera P'et'iroosa misikki goyii Waa kabajin dootisaro tusinya. Hittakko danbbeebaan P'et'iroosane, «Indebee sesseena» ame.<verse eid="JHN 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20"/>P'et'iroosa haararttii gowochiro, Yesuusa geelataa kagire usukko kaɂagaalssatare iso debee kasessetaro dee, hikki usukko kaɂagaalssatare usu goorata kita kahemeene aamaa giraan geegiyo tayesuusa gabbalamere, «Gootta, ku roorisi kasisinara ayyoya?» amaa kagireya. <verse eid="JHN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21"/>P'et'iroosana usu kakkodiyaare goorata, «Gootta! Hikki ibaaddoti misi linnara?» ame hoosate.<verse eid="JHN 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22"/>Yesuusana, «ani taaɂabbaabarotii neefo goggogirroo godootate duuddo ku mekat'ibe? Ati metekkawun indebee sesseena» ame.<verse eid="JHN 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23"/>Hikkakkotti aalanttii hikki Yesuusakko kaɂagaalssatare lakkogooro taɂamatta odu amaniil orroo darɂaantte. Yesuusa ade, ani «Taaɂabbaabaro geegin neefo goggogirroo godootate ku mekat'ibe?» ame kuwaarre lakkogoyinaro ame lakkosegeero. <verse eid="JHN 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24"/>Hikkakokki gara kaɂatotaarana hikka kas'aafera hikka Yesuusakko kaɂagaalssataroya, atonnatina rummi laano noo kanssowa.<verse eid="JHN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25"/>Yesuusa kafelera kakkalee kamooggan ayeesijjool kagira, ayees dubba gos'aafame, kas'aafamero mas'aafa dubbaan alami talleeto banɂe kaɂabo aani lakkollaaro.<verse eid="JHN 21:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21"/>
</usx>
